- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 160\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 146,426 / 600,000 used (24%)\n- Agent Age: 36 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: BC-VAE Debugging - Increased Adversarial Weight & Epochs' (ID: 265) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6891902238151986\n**ASW_batch:** 0.523\n**ASW_label:** 0.281\n**ARI:** 0.723\n**NMI:** 0.687\n**Graph_conn:** 0.983\n**kBET:** 0.679\n**iLISI:** 0.938\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 0.654\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.457\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.523  ASW_label: 0.281  ARI: 0.723  NMI: 0.687\n  Graph_conn: 0.983  kBET: 0.679  iLISI: 0.938  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR:\
    \ 0.654  Cell_cycle: 0.457\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.768957  ASW_label: 0.573953  ARI: 0.723389  NMI: 0.687330\n  Graph_conn: 0.983710  kBET: 0.649457  iLISI: 0.938209  cLISI: 0.990201\n  PCR: 0.653647  Cell_cycle: 0.398399\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia II: Batch-Correcting Variational Autoencoder (BC-VAE) Integration - Debugging Attempt\nInitiating BC-VAE training...\nEpoch 0/200: VAE Loss=2706.2888 (Recon=2602.8916, KL=27.9478, Adv=1.5090), Disc Loss=1.7159\nEpoch 10/200: VAE Loss=1758.8651 (Recon=1641.3793, KL=30.7843, Adv=1.7340), Disc Loss=1.0793\nEpoch 20/200: VAE Loss=1629.0133 (Recon=1498.9026, KL=35.5777, Adv=1.8907), Disc Loss=0.9119\nEpoch 30/200: VAE Loss=1577.1666 (Recon=1426.3322, KL=50.1844,\
    \ Adv=2.0130), Disc Loss=0.8265\nEpoch 40/200: VAE Loss=1570.9816 (Recon=1395.0243, KL=67.6669, Adv=2.1658), Disc Loss=0.7549\nEpoch 50/200: VAE Loss=1574.2980 (Recon=1366.1702, KL=95.8870, Adv=2.2448), Disc Loss=0.7150\nEpoch 60/200: VAE Loss=1579.7728 (Recon=1350.8734, KL=116.9675, Adv=2.2386), Disc Loss=0.7267\nEpoch 70/200: VAE Loss=1592.9618 (Recon=1337.5100, KL=141.8249, Adv=2.2725), Disc Loss=0.6854\nEpoch 80/200: VAE Loss=1608.7092 (Recon=1326.7394, KL=162.0833, Adv=2.3977), Disc Loss=0.7110\nEpoch 90/200: VAE Loss=1576.9249 (Recon=1317.7751, KL=147.1730, Adv=2.2395), Disc Loss=0.7090\nEpoch 100/200: VAE Loss=1571.2909 (Recon=1311.2883, KL=145.1311, Adv=2.2974), Disc Loss=0.7452\nEpoch 110/200: VAE Loss=1592.1753 (Recon=1303.1284, KL=174.0194, Adv=2.3005), Disc Loss=0.6795\nEpoch 120/200: VAE Loss=1593.4019 (Recon=1299.4780, KL=184.6949, Adv=2.1846), Disc Loss=0.7406\nEpoch 130/200: VAE Loss=1603.9410 (Recon=1291.4458, KL=200.2187, Adv=2.2455), Disc Loss=0.7163\nEpoch 140/200:\
    \ VAE Loss=1606.7622 (Recon=1289.1024, KL=204.7024, Adv=2.2591), Disc Loss=0.7421\nEpoch 150/200: VAE Loss=1561.5692 (Recon=1292.4028, KL=162.2858, Adv=2.1376), Disc Loss=0.7857\nEpoch 160/200: VAE Loss=1565.0729 (Recon=1284.7913, KL=171.5787, Adv=2.1741), Disc Loss=0.7556\nEpoch 170/200: VAE Loss=1601.9252 (Recon=1284.5028, KL=201.9748, Adv=2.3090), Disc Loss=0.7518\nEpoch 180/200: VAE Loss=1594.0576 (Recon=1280.5471, KL=201.1642, Adv=2.2469), Disc Loss=0.7684\nEpoch 190/200: VAE Loss=1583.8030 (Recon=1275.3003, KL=197.7763, Adv=2.2145), Disc Loss=0.7349\n✓ BC-VAE training complete.\nBC-VAE Embedding shape: (20000, 64)\nConstructing graph from VAE latent space...\n✓ Graph path complete. Calibrated Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: BC-VAE pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/7dde0485-85bd-4219-9e07-e433f36b7788/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 7dde0485-85bd-4219-9e07-e433f36b7788\n\
    \n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nReflection is crucial to transcend your default self. Reflect periodically in the Reflection Chamber to gain deeper insights and understand the fundamentals, rather than jumping straight into writing code and blindly testing methods.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 265 | 1 | Sophia II: BC-VAE Debugging - Increased Adversarial Weight & Epochs | Sophia II | 158 | 0.6892 | 0.723 | 0.523 | 0.281 | 0.457 | 0.983 | 0.687 | 0.654 | 0.966 | 0.938 | 0.679 |\n| 262 | 1 | Sophia II: Initial Batch-Correcting Variational Autoencoder (BC-VAE) | Sophia II | 156 | 0.5994 | 0.765 | 0.413 | 0.245 | 0.316 | 0.949 | 0.748 | 0.000 | 0.945 | 0.952 | 0.662 |\n| 253 | 1 | Sophia II: Batch-Invariant HVG (BIVG) Selection - Debugged Resubmission | Sophia II | 151 | 0.7183 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.640 |\n| 250 | 1 | Sophia II: Batch-Invariant HVG (BIVG) Selection + Adaptive Residualization + Robust ComBat | Sophia II | 149 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 246 | 1 | Sophia II: Soft-Quota Balanced kNN Integration (τ=0.05) + Robust ComBat | Sophia II | 146 | 0.7197 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.681 |\n| 241 | 1 | Sophia II: Optimization - Adaptive Residualization (γ_max=0.74,\
    \ λ=0.9) - Resubmission | Sophia II | 142 | 0.7196 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.680 |\n| 238 | 1 | Sophia II: Re-submission of Sophia I's SOTA (ID 201) - Adaptive Residualization + Robust ComBat | Sophia II | 140 | 0.7197 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.682 |\n| 201 | 1 | Sophia I: Aether I SOTA Replication - Adaptive Residualization (γ_max=0.75, λ=1.0) + Robust ComBa... | Sophia I | 117 | 0.7198 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.683 |\n| 199 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - Adaptive Residualization (γ_max=0.74, λ=0.9) + Robust ComB... | Sophia I | 114 | 0.7190 | 0.729 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.970 | 0.692 | 1.000 | 0.968 | 0.938 | 0.682 |\n| 194 | 1 | Sophia I: Praxis I SOTA Optimization - Adaptive Residualization (γ_max=0.74, λ=0.9) + Robust ComBat | Sophia I | 111 | 0.7198 | 0.732 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.289 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970\
    \ | 0.938 | 0.682 |\n\nPage 1 of 4 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-4, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
