    This iteration is crucial for determining if increased emphasis on the adversarial loss and longer training can push the `PCR` score closer to 1.0 and improve the overall batch integration performance. The previous submission (ID 265) showed that the adversarial component is active, but not fully optimized for batch effect removal.


