parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 162\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 159,968 / 600,000 used (27%)\n- Agent Age: 38 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: BC-VAE Optimization - Stronger Adversarial Training (adv_weight=100, epochs=300)' (ID: 271) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6718698004494715\n**ASW_batch:** 0.522\n**ASW_label:** 0.299\n**ARI:** 0.730\n**NMI:** 0.712\n**Graph_conn:** 0.964\n**kBET:** 0.650\n**iLISI:** 0.938\n**cLISI:** 0.969\n**PCR:** 0.488\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.447\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.522  ASW_label: 0.299  ARI: 0.730  NMI: 0.712\n  Graph_conn: 0.964  kBET: 0.650  iLISI: 0.938\
