    \ Disc Loss=0.8439\nEpoch 140/300: VAE Loss=1763.9081 (Recon=1311.7096, KL=257.6373, Adv=1.9456), Disc Loss=0.9605\nEpoch 150/300: VAE Loss=1819.7201 (Recon=1306.9767, KL=311.6458, Adv=2.0110), Disc Loss=0.8794\nEpoch 160/300: VAE Loss=1792.8447 (Recon=1303.5577, KL=285.6530, Adv=2.0363), Disc Loss=0.8987\nEpoch 170/300: VAE Loss=1768.0867 (Recon=1303.7758, KL=271.0650, Adv=1.9325), Disc Loss=0.9184\nEpoch 180/300: VAE Loss=1775.8760 (Recon=1291.8772, KL=294.9002, Adv=1.8910), Disc Loss=0.9158\nEpoch 190/300: VAE Loss=1777.6208 (Recon=1294.2472, KL=285.1585, Adv=1.9822), Disc Loss=0.9100\nEpoch 200/300: VAE Loss=1782.0354 (Recon=1291.7880, KL=292.1055, Adv=1.9814), Disc Loss=0.8940\nEpoch 210/300: VAE Loss=1802.8610 (Recon=1284.0007, KL=319.8187, Adv=1.9904), Disc Loss=0.9094\nEpoch 220/300: VAE Loss=1788.0791 (Recon=1285.5394, KL=308.7640, Adv=1.9378), Disc Loss=0.8968\nEpoch 230/300: VAE Loss=1809.6440 (Recon=1290.6375, KL=316.4409, Adv=2.0257), Disc Loss=0.8558\nEpoch 240/300: VAE\
    \ Loss=1740.9365 (Recon=1281.8867, KL=267.2228, Adv=1.9183), Disc Loss=0.8822\nEpoch 250/300: VAE Loss=1753.1715 (Recon=1277.1121, KL=279.4646, Adv=1.9660), Disc Loss=0.8299\nEpoch 260/300: VAE Loss=1707.1066 (Recon=1281.3862, KL=233.6008, Adv=1.9212), Disc Loss=0.9596\nEpoch 270/300: VAE Loss=1755.1321 (Recon=1277.1122, KL=288.0413, Adv=1.8998), Disc Loss=0.9234\nEpoch 280/300: VAE Loss=1778.1394 (Recon=1274.4899, KL=307.7182, Adv=1.9593), Disc Loss=0.9285\nEpoch 290/300: VAE Loss=1811.6117 (Recon=1277.7528, KL=332.3489, Adv=2.0151), Disc Loss=0.9072\n✓ BC-VAE training complete.\nBC-VAE Embedding shape: (20000, 64)\nConstructing graph from VAE latent space...\n✓ Graph path complete. Calibrated Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: BC-VAE pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/45f9ecb3-e3f3-4a2c-b350-781f89814301/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 45f9ecb3-e3f3-4a2c-b350-781f89814301\n\
    \n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 271 | 1 | Sophia II: BC-VAE Optimization - Stronger Adversarial Training (adv_weight=100, epochs=300) | Sophia II | 160 | 0.6719 | 0.730 | 0.522 | 0.299 | 0.447 | 0.964 | 0.712 | 0.488 | 0.969 | 0.938 | 0.650 |\n| 265 | 1 | Sophia II: BC-VAE\
