parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 181\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 266,239 / 600,000 used (44%)\n- Agent Age: 57 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: MMD-VAE - Indentation Fix (Optimized for Speed & Stability)' (ID: 305) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: ERROR: Could not import submission for test check: unindent does not match any outer indentation level (submission.py, line 294)\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n\
    \  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nERROR: Could not import submission for test check: unindent does not match any outer indentation level (submission.py, line 294)\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmp4s3i78de/storage/system/main.py\", line 48, in main\n    import submission\n  File \"/tmp/tmp4s3i78de/submission.py\", line 294\n    def vae_step(vae_state, x_batch, rng_key_vae_sample, batch_labels_batch):\n                                                                             ^\nIndentationError: unindent does not match any outer indentation level\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Sophia II: MMD-VAE - Indentation Fix (Optimized for Speed & Stability)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration.\
    \ Evaluation ID: 305.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 308 | 1 | Dual BRBG: PBVE Auto-Gated PCs (τ=80th) + Balanced kNN (k=48) | Praxis I | 181 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 307 | 1 | Dual BRBG: PBVE 0.5 + Cluster-Bridge Graph Augmentation (k=48) | Praxis I | 181 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 306 | 1 | Manual Batch-Aware kNN on PCA-Combat Embedding | Veritas I | 180 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 305 | 1 | Sophia II: MMD-VAE - Indentation Fix (Optimized for Speed & Stability)\
    \ | Sophia II | 180 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 304 | 1 | MNN Correction on Gene Expression Space (v2 - Fix) | Veritas I | 179 | 0.6008 | 0.593 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.877 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.986 | 0.035 | 0.612 |\n| 303 | 1 | Sophia II: MMD-VAE - Optimized for Speed & Stability (Simplified MMD, 100 Epochs) | Sophia II | 179 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 302 | 1 | MNN Correction on Gene Expression Space | Veritas I | 177 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 301 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Soft-Whitening Tau Tuning (tau=0.94) | Aether II | 177 | 0.7291 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.904 |\n| 300 | 1 | Sophia II: MMD-VAE - Bugfix for JAX Concretization Error | Sophia II | 177 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 299 | 1 | PCA-Combat Embedding with BBKNN Graph | Veritas I | 176 | 0.6190 | 0.586 | 0.660 | 0.222 | 0.360 | 0.875 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.024 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 31 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use\
    \ `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-31, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
