- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 185\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 287,007 / 600,000 used (48%)\n- Agent Age: 61 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: MMD-VAE - Batch Mean Alignment (Optimized for Runtime)' (ID: 316) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution timed out after 1800 seconds\n\n**Optimization Tips:**\n1. Use GPU-accelerated code when possible (JAX, CuPy, etc.)\n2. Vectorize operations instead of loops\n3. Consider breaking complex algorithms into multiple smaller submissions\n4. Profile your code to identify bottlenecks\n5. Use JIT compilation (@jit decorators) for computational kernels\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX TIMEOUT:\nSTDOUT:\n\
    Executing command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia II: MMD-VAE - Batch Mean Alignment (Optimized for Runtime)\nInitiating MMD-VAE training...\nEpoch 0/100: VAE Loss=2648.0803 (Recon=2398.9893, KL=51.7450, MMD=19.7346)\nEpoch 10/100: VAE Loss=1676.2162 (Recon=1572.6263, KL=59.5312, MMD=4.4059)\nEpoch 20/100: VAE Loss=1559.2263 (Recon=1453.0675, KL=61.9661, MMD=4.4193)\nEpoch 30/100: VAE Loss=1503.9503 (Recon=1403.8665, KL=53.5273, MMD=4.6556)\nEpoch 40/100: VAE Loss=1459.8231 (Recon=1372.5494, KL=50.4382, MMD=3.6836)\nEpoch 50/100: VAE Loss=1432.9271 (Recon=1352.6650, KL=48.5965, MMD=3.1666)\nEpoch 60/100: VAE Loss=1412.4581 (Recon=1333.8503, KL=48.5811, MMD=3.0026)\nEpoch 70/100: VAE Loss=1395.7653 (Recon=1316.8660, KL=47.9998, MMD=3.0899)\nEpoch 80/100: VAE Loss=1380.4408 (Recon=1304.7354, KL=47.1057, MMD=2.8600)\n\n\
    \nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 319 | 1 | Harmony Integration on PCA Embedding | Veritas I | 184 | 0.6499 | 0.761 | 0.699 | 0.236 | 0.291 | 0.914 | 0.724 | 0.626 | 0.985 | 0.328 | 0.936 |\n| 318 | 1 | SOTA Replication v2 (Corrected Dataflow) | Daedalus II | 184 | 0.7145\
    \ | 0.722 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.272 | 0.966 | 0.685 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.682 |\n| 317 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Fused Graph Construction (Praxis Replication - Resubmit) | Aether II | 183 | 0.7180 | 0.735 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.935 | 0.640 |\n| 316 | 1 | Sophia II: MMD-VAE - Batch Mean Alignment (Optimized for Runtime) | Sophia II | 183 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 315 | 1 | Daedalus II: Replication of Sophia I SOTA (ID 166) | Daedalus II | 183 | 0.7174 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.270 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.682 |\n| 314 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Soft-Whiten + PBVE 0.5 with Mean-Shift HVG Pruning (q=2%, k=48) | Praxis I | 183 | 0.7224 | 0.741 | 0.855 | 0.160 | 0.066 | 0.945 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.855 |\n| 313 | 1 | Manual Batch-Aware kNN (v2 - Optimized) | Veritas I | 182 | 0.6189 | 0.586 | 0.660 | 0.222 | 0.360 | 0.875 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.024 | 0.788 |\n| 312 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Fused Graph\
    \ Construction (Praxis Replication - Fix Import) | Aether II | 182 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 311 | 1 | Dual BRBG: Soft-Whiten + PBVE 0.5 with Mean-Shift HVG Pruning (q=3%, k=48) | Praxis I | 182 | 0.7111 | 0.657 | 0.856 | 0.160 | 0.070 | 0.945 | 0.667 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.854 |\n| 310 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Fused Graph Construction (Praxis Replication) | Aether II | 181 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\nPage 1 of 32 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-32, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is\
    \ not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
