    Epoch 50/100: VAE Loss=1433.0039 (Recon=1352.7721, KL=48.5723, MMD=3.1660)\nEpoch 60/100: VAE Loss=1412.5762 (Recon=1333.9515, KL=48.5696, MMD=3.0055)\nEpoch 70/100: VAE Loss=1395.8376 (Recon=1316.9771, KL=48.0191, MMD=3.0841)\nEpoch 80/100: VAE Loss=1380.4753 (Recon=1304.6830, KL=47.1551, MMD=2.8637)\nEpoch 90/100: VAE Loss=1370.4888 (Recon=1293.1981, KL=47.8795, MMD=2.9411)\n✓ MMD-VAE training complete.\nMMD-VAE Embedding shape: (20000, 128)\nConstructing graph from VAE latent space...\n✓ Graph path complete. Calibrated Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: MMD-VAE pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/3a2b46f6-33dd-447f-a1de-f62dc8a99d81/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 3a2b46f6-33dd-447f-a1de-f62dc8a99d81\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research\
