    \ Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 333 | 1 | Dual BRBG + BCE (rho=0.5): Stronger CORAL toward Global + Whitening + PBVE | Praxis I | 190 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 332 | 1 | Dual BRBG + BCE (rho=0.3): Per-Batch CORAL toward Global + Whitening + PBVE | Praxis I | 190 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 331 | 1 | Harmony on HVG-selected PCA | Veritas I | 189 | 0.6478 | 0.783 | 0.700 | 0.233 | 0.253 | 0.897 | 0.727 | 0.635 | 0.983 | 0.369 | 0.898 |\n| 330 | 1 | SOTA Replication v4 (scanpy.pp.combat on full genes) | Daedalus II | 189 | 0.7158 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.258 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.678 |\n| 329 | 1 | Dual BRBG + SBT-Graph: Sliced Batch Transport on Graph PCs (n=32, eta=0.15) | Praxis I | 189 | 0.7208 | 0.744\
    \ | 0.852 | 0.161 | 0.081 | 0.946 | 0.704 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.818 |\n| 328 | 1 | Dual BRBG + SBT-Emb: Sliced Batch Transport on Whitened Embedding (n=32, eta=0.2) | Praxis I | 189 | 0.7219 | 0.744 | 0.852 | 0.161 | 0.099 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.813 |\n| 327 | 1 | Harmony Integration on 100 PCs | Veritas I | 187 | 0.6482 | 0.769 | 0.754 | 0.213 | 0.275 | 0.884 | 0.715 | 0.654 | 0.985 | 0.351 | 0.882 |\n| 326 | 1 | Sophia II: MMD-VAE Optimization - Increased MMD & KL Weights (mmd=20, kl=2) | Sophia II | 187 | 0.6890 | 0.744 | 0.447 | 0.232 | 0.296 | 0.919 | 0.691 | 0.993 | 0.927 | 0.938 | 0.703 |\n| 325 | 1 | SOTA Replication v3 (Praxis Robust ComBat) | Daedalus II | 187 | 0.6088 | 0.742 | 0.618 | 0.216 | 0.299 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 0.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.653 |\n| 324 | 1 | Dual BRBG + PBVE with Local-Scaled BalancedGraph (r=20, k=48) | Praxis I | 186 | 0.7197 | 0.730 | 0.852 | 0.161 | 0.084 | 0.948 | 0.686 | 1.000 | 0.964 | 0.952 | 0.820 |\n\nPage 1 of 34 (sorted\
    \ by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-34, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**praxis/brbg_dual_adapt_embed_softwhiten.py:**\n```\nimport numpy as np\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nfrom scipy import sparse as sp\n\nfrom praxis.brbg_common import (\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace, _pca_truncated_svd,\n    _one_hot_batches, _ridge_batch_fit_predict,\n    _build_balanced_knn_equal\n)\n\ndef _ensure_dense_X(adata):\n    if sp.issparse(adata.X):\n        adata.X = adata.X.A\n\ndef _soft_whiten_pcs(adata_emb, key='X_pca', alpha=0.7, eps=1e-8):\n    \"\"\"\n    Soft whitening: Z_scaled = Z / var^(alpha/2), where alpha in [0,1].\n    alpha=0 -> no change; alpha=1 -> full whitening. Recenter columns to 0 mean.\n    \"\"\"\n    Z = adata_emb.obsm[key]\n    var = adata_emb.uns.get('pca', {}).get('variance', None)\n    if\
    \ var is None:\n        return Z\n    scale = np.power(np.clip(var[:Z.shape[1]], eps, None), 0.5 * float(alpha))\n    Zw = Z / scale\n    Zw -= Zw.mean(axis=0, keepdims=True)\n    return Zw\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    # Graph identical to EID 185; embedding uses soft whitening (alpha=0.7)\n    n_pcs_emb = 64\n    n_pcs_graph = 50\n    gamma_max = 0.74\n    lam = 0.9\n    l2 = 1e-3\n    k_total = 48\n    metric = 'cosine'\n    alpha = 0.7\n    random_state = 0\n\n    assert 'batch' in adata.obs.columns\n    assert 'feature_name' in adata.var.columns\n\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, target_sum=1e4)\n    sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, n_top_genes=2000, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', inplace=True)\n    hvg_mask = np.asarray(adata.var['highly_variable'].values, dtype=bool)\n\n    # Graph view (unchanged)\n    Xg = adata.X[:, hvg_mask]\n    if not sp.issparse(Xg):\n        Xg = sp.csr_matrix(Xg)\n    Zg = _pca_truncated_svd(Xg,\
    \ n_comps=n_pcs_graph, random_state=random_state)\n    batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n    B, _ = _one_hot_batches(batches)\n    Zhat, R2 = _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Zg, l2=l2)\n    gamma_vec = np.minimum(gamma_max, lam * R2).astype(np.float32)\n    Zcorr = Zg - Zhat * gamma_vec\n    C, D = _build_balanced_knn_equal(Zcorr, batches, k_total=k_total, metric=metric)\n\n    # Embedding view: ComBat + PCA64 + soft whitening\n    adata_emb = adata.copy()\n    _ensure_dense_X(adata_emb)\n    sc.pp.combat(adata_emb, key='batch')\n    adata_emb.var['highly_variable'] = hvg_mask\n    sc.pp.pca(adata_emb, n_comps=n_pcs_emb, use_highly_variable=True, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=random_state)\n    Zemb = _soft_whiten_pcs(adata_emb, key='X_pca', alpha=alpha, eps=1e-8)\n\n    adata.obsm['X_emb'] = Zemb\n    sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=min(15, k_total), metric=metric)\n    if C is not None and D is not None:\n        adata.obsp['connectivities']\
    \ = C.tocsr()\n        adata.obsp['distances'] = D.tocsr()\n    adata.uns['brbg_dual_adapt_embed_softwhiten'] = {\n        'gamma_max': float(gamma_max), 'lambda': float(lam), 'l2': float(l2),\n        'k_total': int(k_total), 'metric': metric,\n        'pcs_graph': int(n_pcs_graph), 'pcs_emb': int(n_pcs_emb),\n        'embed_soft_whiten_alpha': float(alpha)\n    }\n    return adata\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
