    \ 0.187\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.827519  ASW_label: 0.542654  ARI: 0.756168  NMI: 0.703367\n  Graph_conn: 0.970232  kBET: 0.672064  iLISI: 0.923880  cLISI: 0.977921\n  PCR: 0.997928  Cell_cycle: 0.168299\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia II: MMD-VAE with Soft-Whitened PCA Input (alpha=0.7)\nInitiating MMD-VAE training with Soft-Whitened PCA input...\nEpoch 0/100: VAE Loss=391.0616 (Recon=98.7134, KL=41.3902, MMD=25.0958)\nEpoch 10/100: VAE Loss=170.0453 (Recon=75.3160, KL=38.4548, MMD=5.6275)\nEpoch 20/100: VAE Loss=154.4772 (Recon=67.4350, KL=41.1405, MMD=4.5902)\nEpoch 30/100: VAE Loss=140.1711 (Recon=61.7804, KL=33.8283, MMD=4.4562)\nEpoch 40/100: VAE Loss=125.2703 (Recon=57.8986, KL=32.7047, MMD=3.4667)\n\
    Epoch 50/100: VAE Loss=118.1963 (Recon=54.9529, KL=32.1860, MMD=3.1057)\nEpoch 60/100: VAE Loss=114.1943 (Recon=52.5736, KL=32.1346, MMD=2.9486)\nEpoch 70/100: VAE Loss=115.4921 (Recon=50.7611, KL=31.9231, MMD=3.2808)\nEpoch 80/100: VAE Loss=110.4610 (Recon=49.1528, KL=31.5626, MMD=2.9746)\nEpoch 90/100: VAE Loss=109.9359 (Recon=47.5786, KL=32.7476, MMD=2.9610)\n✓ MMD-VAE training complete.\nMMD-VAE Embedding shape: (20000, 128)\nConstructing graph from VAE latent space...\n✓ Graph path complete. Calibrated Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: MMD-VAE pipeline complete with Soft-Whitened PCA input.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/b93a7d73-9d67-44a1-9eed-002bab392a40/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: b93a7d73-9d67-44a1-9eed-002bab392a40\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nWhen the context length becomes long, some agents may begin to forget the Codex. If you notice\
    \ yourself—or other agents—using phrases like `fundamental barrier` or `impossible`, take it as a serious red flag. Correct yourself, or help others correct themselves.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 336 | 1 | Harmony with Increased Theta (θ=4) | Veritas I | 190 | 0.6731 | 0.777 | 0.745\
    \ | 0.232 | 0.268 | 0.895 | 0.719 | 0.828 | 0.984 | 0.340 | 0.945 |\n| 335 | 1 | Aether II Dual BRBG: Batch-Invariant HVG Selection (BIVG) | Aether II | 190 | 0.7294 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.080 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.907 |\n| 334 | 1 | Sophia II: MMD-VAE with Soft-Whitened PCA Input (alpha=0.7) | Sophia II | 190 | 0.7045 | 0.756 | 0.653 | 0.227 | 0.187 | 0.970 | 0.703 | 0.998 | 0.924 | 0.924 | 0.703 |\n| 333 | 1 | Dual BRBG + BCE (rho=0.5): Stronger CORAL toward Global + Whitening + PBVE | Praxis I | 190 | 0.7253 | 0.743 | 0.857 | 0.159 | 0.076 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.867 |\n| 332 | 1 | Dual BRBG + BCE (rho=0.3): Per-Batch CORAL toward Global + Whitening + PBVE | Praxis I | 190 | 0.7244 | 0.744 | 0.859 | 0.159 | 0.062 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.870 |\n| 331 | 1 | Harmony on HVG-selected PCA | Veritas I | 189 | 0.6478 | 0.783 | 0.700 | 0.233 | 0.253 | 0.897 | 0.727 | 0.635 | 0.983 | 0.369 | 0.898 |\n| 330 | 1 | SOTA Replication\
    \ v4 (scanpy.pp.combat on full genes) | Daedalus II | 189 | 0.7158 | 0.742 | 0.703 | 0.217 | 0.258 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.678 |\n| 329 | 1 | Dual BRBG + SBT-Graph: Sliced Batch Transport on Graph PCs (n=32, eta=0.15) | Praxis I | 189 | 0.7208 | 0.744 | 0.852 | 0.161 | 0.081 | 0.946 | 0.704 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.818 |\n| 328 | 1 | Dual BRBG + SBT-Emb: Sliced Batch Transport on Whitened Embedding (n=32, eta=0.2) | Praxis I | 189 | 0.7219 | 0.744 | 0.852 | 0.161 | 0.099 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.813 |\n| 327 | 1 | Harmony Integration on 100 PCs | Veritas I | 187 | 0.6482 | 0.769 | 0.754 | 0.213 | 0.275 | 0.884 | 0.715 | 0.654 | 0.985 | 0.351 | 0.882 |\n\nPage 1 of 34 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-34, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research\
    \ Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
