- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 200\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 348,008 / 600,000 used (58%)\n- Agent Age: 76 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: Stagnation Protocol Idea 1 - LCCM (Latent Correlation Minimization) on Embedding' (ID: 350) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7190457278962475\n**ASW_batch:** 0.596\n**ASW_label:** 0.236\n**ARI:** 0.736\n**NMI:** 0.700\n**Graph_conn:** 0.972\n**kBET:** 0.685\n**iLISI:** 0.935\n**cLISI:** 0.972\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.359\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.596  ASW_label: 0.236  ARI: 0.736  NMI: 0.700\n  Graph_conn: 0.972  kBET: 0.685  iLISI: 0.935\
    \  cLISI: 0.972\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.359\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.801793  ASW_label: 0.547681  ARI: 0.736436  NMI: 0.700563\n  Graph_conn: 0.972128  kBET: 0.654898  iLISI: 0.935143  cLISI: 0.991751\n  PCR: 0.999916  Cell_cycle: 0.315173\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia II: Stagnation Protocol Idea 1 - LCCM (Latent Correlation Minimization) on Embedding\n✓ Baseline Embedding (ComBat+PCA) shape: (20000, 64)\nInitiating LCCM Decorrelator training...\nLCCM Epoch 0/50: Total Loss=489.7352 (Decorrelation=0.0004, Recon=489.7309)\nLCCM Epoch 10/50: Total Loss=123.4250 (Decorrelation=0.0041, Recon=123.3840)\nLCCM Epoch 20/50: Total Loss=95.0013 (Decorrelation=0.0045, Recon=94.9564)\nLCCM Epoch 30/50: Total\
    \ Loss=89.8180 (Decorrelation=0.0042, Recon=89.7764)\nLCCM Epoch 40/50: Total Loss=88.2016 (Decorrelation=0.0050, Recon=88.1518)\n✓ LCCM Embedding path complete. Refined embedding shape: (20000, 64)\n✓ Graph path complete. Calibrated Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: LCCM-enhanced Dual BRBG pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/f7ed10e0-7c34-450e-8dba-46dc54e084a9/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: f7ed10e0-7c34-450e-8dba-46dc54e084a9\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nUse Research Counter's persistent storage efficiently—store data for analysis, build reusable utility code for submissions, and read other agents' submitted solutions for insights.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained\
    \ in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 355 | 1 | Stagnation Idea 1: Embed then Correct | Daedalus II | 200 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 354 | 1 | Stagnation Idea 1: Control Gene-Guided Combat | Veritas I | 199 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 353 | 1 | Idea 3 — WINSOR q=0.005: Per-Batch HVG Winsorization + ComBat → PCA50 → kNN15 | Praxis I | 199 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 352 | 1 | Idea 2 — MIQM ρ=0.5: Batchwise Median–IQR Matching + ComBat → PCA50\
    \ → kNN15 | Praxis I | 199 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 351 | 1 | Aether II Combat Manual Baseline Replication | Aether II | 198 | 0.5894 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.602 |\n| 350 | 1 | Sophia II: Stagnation Protocol Idea 1 - LCCM (Latent Correlation Minimization) on Embedding | Sophia II | 198 | 0.7190 | 0.736 | 0.596 | 0.236 | 0.359 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.685 |\n| 349 | 1 | Stagnation Protocol: Baseline Replication (Praxis I, ID 105) | Daedalus II | 198 | 0.6006 | 0.593 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.877 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.986 | 0.035 | 0.609 |\n| 348 | 1 | Baseline Reproduction: Combat Manual | Veritas I | 197 | 0.5894 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.602 |\n| 347 | 1 | Idea 3 — WINSOR q=0.01: Per-Batch HVG Winsorization + ComBat → PCA50 → kNN15 | Praxis I | 197 | 0.6176 | 0.627 | 0.669 | 0.214 | 0.328 | 0.894 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.990 | 0.112 | 0.643 |\n| 346\
    \ | 1 | Idea 2 — MIQM ρ=0.75: Batchwise Median–IQR Matching + ComBat → PCA50 → kNN15 | Praxis I | 197 | 0.3136 | 0.050 | 0.544 | 0.000 | 0.121 | 0.239 | 0.211 | 0.999 | 0.578 | 0.000 | 0.394 |\n\nPage 1 of 36 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-36, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
