- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 202\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 359,668 / 600,000 used (60%)\n- Agent Age: 78 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: Stagnation Protocol Idea 2 - Multi-Scale Adaptive Neighborhood Fusion (MSANF)' (ID: 356) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7120142930279666\n**ASW_batch:** 0.693\n**ASW_label:** 0.217\n**ARI:** 0.706\n**NMI:** 0.670\n**Graph_conn:** 0.973\n**kBET:** 0.640\n**iLISI:** 0.935\n**cLISI:** 0.969\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.318\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.693  ASW_label: 0.217  ARI: 0.706  NMI: 0.670\n  Graph_conn: 0.973  kBET: 0.640  iLISI: 0.935\
    \  cLISI: 0.969\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.318\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.845559  ASW_label: 0.536834  ARI: 0.705663  NMI: 0.670285\n  Graph_conn: 0.973289  kBET: 0.612877  iLISI: 0.935252  cLISI: 0.990863\n  PCR: 1.000000  Cell_cycle: 0.280022\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia II: Stagnation Protocol Idea 2 - Multi-Scale Adaptive Neighborhood Fusion (MSANF)\n✓ Embedding path complete. ComBat PCA embedding shape: (20000, 64)\n  - Built graph with k_total=30. Shape: (20000, 20000)\n  - Built graph with k_total=60. Shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Fused graph path complete. Fused graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: MSANF-enhanced Dual BRBG pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n\
    \  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/25ed4ae4-14af-408f-8e4b-27576e47c254/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 25ed4ae4-14af-408f-8e4b-27576e47c254\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 359 | 1 | Stagnation Idea 2: Batch-Informed Feature Selection | Daedalus\
    \ II | 202 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 358 | 1 | Stagnation Idea 2: Locally-Adaptive Combat | Veritas I | 201 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 357 | 1 | Aether II Combat: Adaptive Batch-Specific Shrinkage (Factor 0.1) | Aether II | 201 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 356 | 1 | Sophia II: Stagnation Protocol Idea 2 - Multi-Scale Adaptive Neighborhood Fusion (MSANF) | Sophia II | 200 | 0.7120 | 0.706 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.973 | 0.670 | 1.000 | 0.969 | 0.935 | 0.640 |\n| 355 | 1 | Stagnation Idea 1: Embed then Correct | Daedalus II | 200 | 0.6188 | 0.586 | 0.660 | 0.222 | 0.360 | 0.875 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.024 | 0.787 |\n| 354 | 1 | Stagnation Idea 1: Control Gene-Guided Combat | Veritas I | 199 | 0.2236 | 0.000 | 1.000 | 0.153 | 0.000 | 0.116 | 0.012 | 0.000 | 0.102 | 0.553 | 0.301 |\n| 353 | 1 | Idea 3 — WINSOR q=0.005: Per-Batch HVG Winsorization + ComBat → PCA50 → kNN15 | Praxis I | 199 | 0.6158 | 0.632 | 0.667 | 0.218 | 0.325 |\
    \ 0.895 | 0.704 | 1.000 | 0.992 | 0.117 | 0.608 |\n| 352 | 1 | Idea 2 — MIQM ρ=0.5: Batchwise Median–IQR Matching + ComBat → PCA50 → kNN15 | Praxis I | 199 | 0.3294 | 0.061 | 0.561 | 0.000 | 0.116 | 0.289 | 0.219 | 0.999 | 0.653 | 0.000 | 0.396 |\n| 351 | 1 | Aether II Combat Manual Baseline Replication | Aether II | 198 | 0.5894 | 0.493 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.885 | 0.683 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.033 | 0.602 |\n| 350 | 1 | Sophia II: Stagnation Protocol Idea 1 - LCCM (Latent Correlation Minimization) on Embedding | Sophia II | 198 | 0.7190 | 0.736 | 0.596 | 0.236 | 0.359 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.685 |\n\nPage 1 of 36 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-36, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation\
    \ & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
