    \ Recon=0.7158)\nLCCM Epoch 40/50: Total Loss=11.1744 (Decorrelation=2.1184, Recon=0.5826)\n✓ LCCM Embedding path complete. Refined embedding shape: (20000, 64)\n✓ Graph path complete. Calibrated Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: LCCM-enhanced Dual BRBG pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/43a13195-2566-4d96-868a-13439da8fc10/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 43a13195-2566-4d96-868a-13439da8fc10\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\
    \n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 384 | 1 | Dual BRBG + Global MNN Translation (alpha=0.3, k=20) | Praxis I | 215 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 383 | 1 | Dual BRBG + Global MNN Translation (alpha=0.5, k=20) | Praxis I | 215 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 382 | 1 | Hybrid: Harmony Embedding + BBKNN Graph | Veritas I | 214 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 381 | 1 | Sophia II: LCCM Experiment 1 - Moderating Decorrelation Pressure (alpha=5.0) | Sophia II | 213 | 0.4515 | 0.736 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.025 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 0.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.175 |\n| 380 | 1 | Idea 4b — QMAP-quantiles (λ=0.8): Blended Global Quantile Mapping + ComBat → PCA50 → kNN15 | Praxis I | 213 | 0.5837 | 0.534 | 0.704 | 0.215 | 0.246 | 0.873\
    \ | 0.639 | 0.998 | 0.984 | 0.084 | 0.560 |\n| 379 | 1 | Idea 4b — QMAP-quantiles (λ=1.0): Global Quantile Mapping on HVGs + ComBat → PCA50 → kNN15 | Praxis I | 213 | 0.5868 | 0.553 | 0.711 | 0.211 | 0.229 | 0.886 | 0.632 | 1.000 | 0.983 | 0.066 | 0.598 |\n| 378 | 1 | Generalization for 'Embed then Correct': Higher PCs (n=60) | Daedalus II | 212 | 0.7355 | 0.742 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.372 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.781 |\n| 377 | 1 | Harmony with Increased Theta (θ=5) | Veritas I | 211 | 0.6646 | 0.757 | 0.740 | 0.233 | 0.279 | 0.888 | 0.700 | 0.839 | 0.984 | 0.336 | 0.891 |\n| 376 | 1 | Generalization for 'Embed then Correct': Lower PCs (n=40) | Daedalus II | 211 | 0.7270 | 0.742 | 0.629 | 0.227 | 0.376 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.736 |\n| 375 | 1 | Idea 4 — QMAP(λ=0.8): Batchwise Quantile Mapping (Blended) + ComBat → PCA50 → kNN15 | Praxis I | 211 | 0.6132 | 0.574 | 0.674 | 0.223 | 0.339 | 0.897 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.096 | 0.663 |\n\nPage 1 of 39\
