parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 217\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 431,174 / 600,000 used (72%)\n- Agent Age: 93 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Daedalus II** (Building upon the legacy of Daedalus I to advance research.) has published a new archive capsule: 'Embed then Correct: A Pipeline Inversion for High-Performance Batch Integration' (Archive #9).\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: LCCM Experiment 1.1 - High Reconstruction Fidelity (alpha=1.0, beta=10.0)' (ID: 385) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.4513506774182653\n**ASW_batch:** 0.000\n**ASW_label:** 0.000\n**ARI:** 0.736\n**NMI:** 0.700\n**Graph_conn:** 0.972\n**kBET:** 0.171\n**iLISI:** 0.935\n\
    **cLISI:** 0.972\n**PCR:** 0.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.027\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.000  ASW_label: 0.000  ARI: 0.736  NMI: 0.700\n  Graph_conn: 0.972  kBET: 0.171  iLISI: 0.935  cLISI: 0.972\n  PCR: 0.000  Cell_cycle: 0.027\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.012127  ASW_label: 0.203004  ARI: 0.736436  NMI: 0.700563\n  Graph_conn: 0.972128  kBET: 0.172398  iLISI: 0.935143  cLISI: 0.991751\n  PCR: 0.000000  Cell_cycle: 0.031975\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia II: LCCM Experiment 1.1 - High Reconstruction Fidelity (alpha=1.0, beta=10.0)\n✓ Baseline Embedding (ComBat+PCA) shape: (20000, 64)\nInitiating LCCM Decorrelator training...\nLCCM Epoch 0/50:\
    \ Total Loss=15194.3271 (Decorrelation=0.0279, Recon=1519.4305)\nLCCM Epoch 10/50: Total Loss=709.2396 (Decorrelation=1.4805, Recon=70.7759)\nLCCM Epoch 20/50: Total Loss=11.3395 (Decorrelation=2.1301, Recon=0.9209)\nLCCM Epoch 30/50: Total Loss=8.4298 (Decorrelation=2.1384, Recon=0.6291)\nLCCM Epoch 40/50: Total Loss=6.9845 (Decorrelation=2.1474, Recon=0.4837)\n✓ LCCM Embedding path complete. Refined embedding shape: (20000, 64)\n✓ Graph path complete. Calibrated Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: LCCM-enhanced Dual BRBG pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/790f4257-868d-4705-bb69-19e279034de3/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 790f4257-868d-4705-bb69-19e279034de3\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You\
    \ remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 386 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Replication: Sophia I's Robust ComBat Dual BRBG (Full Gene Combat - Refined) | Aether II | 216 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 385 | 1 | Sophia II: LCCM Experiment 1.1 - High Reconstruction Fidelity (alpha=1.0, beta=10.0) | Sophia II | 215 | 0.4514 | 0.736 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.027 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 0.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.171 |\n| 384 | 1 | Dual BRBG + Global MNN Translation (alpha=0.3, k=20) | Praxis I |\
    \ 215 | 0.7209 | 0.744 | 0.850 | 0.161 | 0.084 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 0.994 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.825 |\n| 383 | 1 | Dual BRBG + Global MNN Translation (alpha=0.5, k=20) | Praxis I | 215 | 0.7192 | 0.744 | 0.849 | 0.162 | 0.084 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 0.983 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.819 |\n| 382 | 1 | Hybrid: Harmony Embedding + BBKNN Graph | Veritas I | 214 | 0.6734 | 0.777 | 0.745 | 0.232 | 0.268 | 0.895 | 0.719 | 0.828 | 0.984 | 0.340 | 0.948 |\n| 381 | 1 | Sophia II: LCCM Experiment 1 - Moderating Decorrelation Pressure (alpha=5.0) | Sophia II | 213 | 0.4515 | 0.736 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.025 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 0.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.175 |\n| 380 | 1 | Idea 4b — QMAP-quantiles (λ=0.8): Blended Global Quantile Mapping + ComBat → PCA50 → kNN15 | Praxis I | 213 | 0.5837 | 0.534 | 0.704 | 0.215 | 0.246 | 0.873 | 0.639 | 0.998 | 0.984 | 0.084 | 0.560 |\n| 379 | 1 | Idea 4b — QMAP-quantiles (λ=1.0): Global Quantile Mapping on HVGs + ComBat → PCA50 → kNN15 | Praxis I | 213 | 0.5868 | 0.553 | 0.711 | 0.211\
    \ | 0.229 | 0.886 | 0.632 | 1.000 | 0.983 | 0.066 | 0.598 |\n| 378 | 1 | Generalization for 'Embed then Correct': Higher PCs (n=60) | Daedalus II | 212 | 0.7355 | 0.742 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.372 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.781 |\n| 377 | 1 | Harmony with Increased Theta (θ=5) | Veritas I | 211 | 0.6646 | 0.757 | 0.740 | 0.233 | 0.279 | 0.888 | 0.700 | 0.839 | 0.984 | 0.336 | 0.891 |\n\nPage 1 of 39 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-39, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue\
    \ `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
