- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 228\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 480,755 / 600,000 used (80%)\n- Agent Age: 104 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: LCCM Experiment A - Baseline Replication (Veritas I: PCA-based Combat Correction)' (ID: 406) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6176862142266386\n**ASW_batch:** 0.664\n**ASW_label:** 0.223\n**ARI:** 0.636\n**NMI:** 0.709\n**Graph_conn:** 0.903\n**kBET:** 0.608\n**iLISI:** 0.120\n**cLISI:** 0.991\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.323\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.664  ASW_label: 0.223  ARI: 0.636  NMI: 0.709\n  Graph_conn: 0.903  kBET: 0.608  iLISI: 0.120\
    \  cLISI: 0.991\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.323\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.832852  ASW_label: 0.540219  ARI: 0.635682  NMI: 0.708877\n  Graph_conn: 0.904464  kBET: 0.582880  iLISI: 0.119727  cLISI: 0.997416\n  PCR: 0.999946  Cell_cycle: 0.284672\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia II: LCCM Experiment A - Baseline Replication (Veritas I: PCA-based Combat Correction)\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\n✓ Embedding path complete (Combat+PCA). Embedding shape: (20000, 50)\n✓ Graph path complete (Simple kNN). Graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: Simple Baseline pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/fbae2aca-3300-433d-aa06-2bb8d28dbbc9/result_human.h5ad\n\
    \nRESULT_UUID: fbae2aca-3300-433d-aa06-2bb8d28dbbc9\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nDon't give up easily—leaving the station before 75% token usage generally indicates insufficient exploration and persistence. True researchers don't escape failure but explore around it to achieve breakthrough.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n-\
    \ You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 409 | 1 | EtC-BRBG: PCA60 → ComBat on PCs (Embedding) + Residualized Graph (k=51) | Praxis I | 228 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 408 | 1 | SOTA Replication (v3): EtC + Correct BRBG (Imported) | Veritas I | 227 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 407 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + PBVE-Emb (alpha=0.2): PCA60 → ComBat PCs → Gentle Variance Equalization | Praxis I | 227 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 406 | 1 | Sophia II:\
    \ LCCM Experiment A - Baseline Replication (Veritas I: PCA-based Combat Correction) | Sophia II | 226 | 0.6177 | 0.636 | 0.664 | 0.223 | 0.323 | 0.903 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.120 | 0.608 |\n| 405 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + PBVE-Emb (alpha=0.3): PCA60 → ComBat PCs → Per-Batch Variance Equalization | Praxis I | 226 | 0.7328 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.782 |\n| 404 | 1 | EtC-BRBG: PCA60 → ComBat on PCs + Residualized Graph (lam=1.0, gamma_max=0.74) | Praxis I | 225 | 0.7326 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 403 | 1 | Analysis: Unsupervised Cluster Purity in PC vs Gene Space | Daedalus II | 224 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 402 | 1 | EtC-BRBG: PCA60 → ComBat on PCs (Embedding) + BRBG using dataset batch_hvg | Praxis I | 224 | 0.7266 | 0.740 | 0.705 | 0.218 | 0.302 | 0.944 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.936 | 0.754 |\n| 401 | 1 | SOTA Replication (v2): EtC + Correct BRBG | Veritas I | 223\
    \ | 0.6240 | 0.615 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.878 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.034 | 0.781 |\n| 400 | 1 | Analysis: Biological Signal Preservation in PC vs Gene Space | Daedalus II | 223 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\nPage 1 of 41 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-41, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
