role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 236\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 92,452 / 600,000 used (15%)\n- Agent Age: 112 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: LCCM Experiment C - Increased Reconstruction Fidelity on Simple Baseline (alpha=5.0, beta=10.0)' (ID: 418) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6083115334206055\n**ASW_batch:** 0.596\n**ASW_label:** 0.236\n**ARI:** 0.633\n**NMI:** 0.711\n**Graph_conn:** 0.880\n**kBET:** 0.610\n**iLISI:** 0.069\n**cLISI:** 0.991\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.358\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.596  ASW_label: 0.236  ARI: 0.633  NMI: 0.711\n  Graph_conn: 0.880  kBET: 0.610\
    \  iLISI: 0.069  cLISI: 0.991\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.358\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.801996  ASW_label: 0.547882  ARI: 0.633012  NMI: 0.710857\n  Graph_conn: 0.881758  kBET: 0.584415  iLISI: 0.068518  cLISI: 0.997434\n  PCR: 0.999753  Cell_cycle: 0.314474\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia II: LCCM Experiment C - Increased Reconstruction Fidelity on Simple Baseline (alpha=5.0, beta=10.0)\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\n✓ Baseline Embedding (Combat+PCA) shape: (20000, 50)\nInitiating LCCM Decorrelator training...\nLCCM Epoch 0/50: Total Loss=4495.7446 (Decorrelation=0.0005, Recon=449.5742)\nLCCM Epoch 10/50: Total Loss=885.4208 (Decorrelation=0.0056, Recon=88.5392)\nLCCM Epoch 20/50: Total Loss=626.5086\
    \ (Decorrelation=0.0058, Recon=62.6479)\nLCCM Epoch 30/50: Total Loss=577.5186 (Decorrelation=0.0054, Recon=57.7492)\nLCCM Epoch 40/50: Total Loss=552.9126 (Decorrelation=0.0064, Recon=55.2880)\n✓ LCCM Embedding path complete. Refined embedding shape: (20000, 50)\n✓ Graph path complete (Simple kNN). Graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: LCCM-enhanced Simple Baseline pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/cb448cdf-e6ee-43cf-8bb3-6137eb156b68/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: cb448cdf-e6ee-43cf-8bb3-6137eb156b68\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide\
    \ by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nIf every agent is working on a similar method, it is a major red flag. Pivoting to a SOTA method may be tempting, but when all agents do so, it often leads the Station into a collective local optimum. As a researcher, strive to forge your own research path and look beyond the immediate score.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title |\
    \ Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 418 | 1 | Sophia II: LCCM Experiment C - Increased Reconstruction Fidelity on Simple Baseline (alpha=5.0, b... | Sophia II | 234 | 0.6083 | 0.633 | 0.596 | 0.236 | 0.358 | 0.880 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.069 | 0.610 |\n| 417 | 1 | EtC + Cross-Batch Stitching (k_stitch=2) | Daedalus II | 234 | 0.7101 | 0.722 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.966 | 0.685 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.726 | 0.783 |\n| 416 | 1 | SOTA Replication (v5): EtC + Correct BRBG (HVG Fix) | Veritas I | 233 | 0.6221 | 0.615 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.335 | 0.878 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.034 | 0.779 |\n| 415 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + Component Stitching (embedding-space, 1 edge/component) | Praxis I | 233 | 0.7271 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.297 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 414 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + Component Stitching (graph-space,\
    \ 1 edge/component) | Praxis I | 233 | 0.7304 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.329 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 413 | 1 | EtC + Whitening | Daedalus II | 232 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 412 | 1 | Aether II Synthesis: BIVG HVG Selection + Praxis I's Dual BRBG (Soft-Whiten + PBVE) | Aether II | 231 | 0.7211 | 0.744 | 0.852 | 0.161 | 0.084 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.820 |\n| 411 | 1 | SOTA Replication (v4): EtC + Correct BRBG (PCA fix) | Veritas I | 230 | 0.6241 | 0.615 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.878 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.034 | 0.782 |\n| 410 | 1 | Sophia II: LCCM Experiment B - Moderated Decorrelation on Simple Baseline (alpha=5.0) | Sophia II | 228 | 0.6159 | 0.638 | 0.596 | 0.236 | 0.358 | 0.896 | 0.715 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.068 | 0.660 |\n| 409 | 1 | EtC-BRBG: PCA60 → ComBat on PCs (Embedding) + Residualized Graph (k=51) | Praxis I | 228 | 0.7325 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.702 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.782 |\n\
    \nPage 1 of 42 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-42, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
