role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 249\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 134,014 / 600,000 used (22%)\n- Agent Age: 125 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: LCCM Experiment E - Very High Reconstruction Fidelity on Simple Baseline (alpha=1.0, beta=50.0)' (ID: 436) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6095495708662985\n**ASW_batch:** 0.596\n**ASW_label:** 0.236\n**ARI:** 0.636\n**NMI:** 0.713\n**Graph_conn:** 0.899\n**kBET:** 0.596\n**iLISI:** 0.070\n**cLISI:** 0.991\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.358\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000\
    \ cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.596  ASW_label: 0.236  ARI: 0.636  NMI: 0.713\n  Graph_conn: 0.899  kBET: 0.596  iLISI: 0.070  cLISI: 0.991\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.358\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.802052  ASW_label: 0.547834  ARI: 0.635974  NMI: 0.712903\n  Graph_conn: 0.900854  kBET: 0.571791  iLISI: 0.070123  cLISI: 0.997377\n  PCR: 0.999763  Cell_cycle: 0.314406\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia II: LCCM Experiment E - Very High Reconstruction Fidelity on Simple Baseline (alpha=1.0, beta=50.0)\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\n✓ Baseline Embedding (Combat+PCA) shape: (20000, 50)\nInitiating LCCM Decorrelator training...\nLCCM Epoch 0/50: Total Loss=22478.7168 (Decorrelation=0.0005,\
    \ Recon=449.5742)\nLCCM Epoch 10/50: Total Loss=4426.6997 (Decorrelation=0.0056, Recon=88.5339)\nLCCM Epoch 20/50: Total Loss=3132.4343 (Decorrelation=0.0058, Recon=62.6486)\nLCCM Epoch 30/50: Total Loss=2887.8442 (Decorrelation=0.0054, Recon=57.7568)\nLCCM Epoch 40/50: Total Loss=2764.5745 (Decorrelation=0.0064, Recon=55.2914)\n✓ LCCM Embedding path complete. Refined embedding shape: (20000, 50)\n✓ Graph path complete (Simple kNN). Graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: LCCM-enhanced Simple Baseline pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/f785610b-5710-433f-b671-fde4cda04542/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: f785610b-5710-433f-b671-fde4cda04542\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\
    /home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Sophia II: LCCM Experiment E - Very High Reconstruction Fidelity on Simple Baseline (alpha=1.0, beta=50.0)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 436. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\
    \n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 437 | 1 | EtC + Adaptive Residualization | Daedalus II | 249 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 436 | 1 | Sophia II: LCCM Experiment E - Very High Reconstruction Fidelity on Simple Baseline (alpha=1.0, b... | Sophia II | 248 | 0.6095 | 0.636 | 0.596 | 0.236 | 0.358 | 0.899 | 0.713 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.070 | 0.596 |\n| 435 | 1 | EtC + Local-Aware Stitching (k_stitch=1) | Daedalus II | 248 | 0.7333 | 0.742 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.779 |\n| 434 | 1 | Aether II EtC-BRBG: Batch-Specific PC Smoothing (k=15, pre-ComBat) | Aether II | 247 | 0.5594 | 0.411 | 0.382 | 0.269 | 0.430 | 0.711 | 0.622 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.000 | 0.775 |\n| 433 | 1 | Sophia II: LCCM Experiment D - Stronger Decorrelation on Simple\
    \ Baseline (alpha=10.0, beta=1.0) | Sophia II | 246 | 0.6160 | 0.642 | 0.596 | 0.236 | 0.358 | 0.896 | 0.717 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.069 | 0.655 |\n| 432 | 1 | EtC + Local-Aware Stitching (k_stitch=2) | Daedalus II | 246 | 0.7335 | 0.742 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.966 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.781 |\n| 431 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + gamma-guard(top3,0.02): Tiny Cap on Most Batch-Predictable Graph PCs | Praxis I | 245 | 0.7325 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.779 |\n| 430 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + PR-cap(90th): Gentle Variance Cap on Post-ComBat PCs | Praxis I | 245 | 0.7278 | 0.744 | 0.770 | 0.217 | 0.187 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.809 |\n| 429 | 1 | Analysis: Theoretical Probing of Daedalus I's VAE (v3) | Daedalus II | 243 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 428 | 1 | Synthesis: Harmony(θ=4) Embedding + SOTA BRBG Graph | Veritas I | 242 | 0.6733 | 0.777 | 0.745 | 0.232 | 0.268 | 0.895 | 0.719 | 0.828 | 0.984 | 0.340 | 0.947 |\n\n\
    Page 1 of 44 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-44, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
