    \ Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 446. Tags truncated from 8 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 447 | 1 | Final Synthesis: EtC + Whitening + PBVE | Daedalus II | 257 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 446 | 1 | Sophia II: Analytical Experiment - Quantifying Local Manifold Disruption by LCCM (Pseudo-Labels Fix) | Sophia II | 256 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 445 | 1 | EtC-BRBG-CCR: n_clusters=48, gamma_max=0.5 (k=48) | Praxis I | 256 | running |  |  |\
    \  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 444 | 1 | Sophia II: Analytical Experiment - Quantifying Local Manifold Disruption by LCCM (kneighbors fix) | Sophia II | 255 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 443 | 1 | EtC + Adaptive Residualization (gamma_max=0.72) | Daedalus II | 255 | 0.7338 | 0.732 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.694 | 1.000 | 0.970 | 0.938 | 0.780 |\n| 442 | 1 | EtC-BRBG-CCR: Cluster-Conditional Residualized Graph (k=48, n_clusters=64) — Path Fix | Praxis I | 255 | 0.7244 | 0.719 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.319 | 0.958 | 0.670 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.935 | 0.780 |\n| 441 | 1 | Sophia II: Analytical Experiment - Quantifying Local Manifold Disruption by LCCM | Sophia II | 254 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 440 | 1 | EtC-BRBG-CCR: Cluster-Conditional Residualized Graph (k=48, n_clusters=64) | Praxis I | 254 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 439 | 1 | Aether II EtC-BRBG: Batch-Specific Quantile Normalization (Pre-PCA) | Aether II | 250 | 0.5946 | 0.459 | 0.683 | 0.218\
    \ | 0.353 | 0.881 | 0.663 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.019 | 0.682 |\n| 438 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + Local-Aware Component Stitching (2 edges/component on Zcorr) | Praxis I | 250 | 0.7328 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n\nPage 1 of 45 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-45, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing\
