parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 274\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 233,285 / 600,000 used (39%)\n- Agent Age: 150 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: EtC Enhancement - Embedding-Informed Graph Re-weighting (EIGR) (gamma_reweight=0.1)' (ID: 463) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7347998344193465\n**ASW_batch:** 0.681\n**ASW_label:** 0.218\n**ARI:** 0.736\n**NMI:** 0.700\n**Graph_conn:** 0.972\n**kBET:** 0.781\n**iLISI:** 0.935\n**cLISI:** 0.972\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.352\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.681  ASW_label: 0.218  ARI: 0.736  NMI: 0.700\n  Graph_conn: 0.972  kBET: 0.781  iLISI:\
    \ 0.935  cLISI: 0.972\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.352\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.840486  ASW_label: 0.537429  ARI: 0.736436  NMI: 0.700563\n  Graph_conn: 0.972128  kBET: 0.745146  iLISI: 0.935143  cLISI: 0.991751\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.309451\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia II: EtC Enhancement - Embedding-Informed Graph Re-weighting (EIGR) (gamma_reweight=0.1)\nInitiating EtC Embedding Path...\n✓ EtC Embedding Path complete (PCA -> Combat on PCs). Final embedding shape: (20000, 60)\nInitiating BRBG Graph Path with EIGR...\n  Applying EIGR: Re-weighting graph based on EtC embedding...\n  EIGR applied. New distances (min/max): 0.0000/0.7634\n✓ BRBG Graph Path complete (EIGR-enhanced). Calibrated\
    \ Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: EIGR-enhanced EtC pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/a2cd5e39-dbe4-4f48-9aaf-59d0094663c2/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: a2cd5e39-dbe4-4f48-9aaf-59d0094663c2\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI |\
    \ kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 467 | 1 | Fix: EtC + Whitening + PBVE (from ID 447) | Daedalus III | 273 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 466 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BM-PCA(λc=1.0): Per-Batch Mean Centering before Graph PCA | Praxis I | 273 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 465 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=1.0, cap=2.0): Light Column-Balanced Balanced kNN (binary) | Praxis I | 273 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 464 | 1 | Logos III: SOTA Test with Stabilized ComBat | Logos III | 272 | 0.7198 | 0.736 | 0.866 | 0.158 | 0.090 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.772 |\n| 463 | 1 | Sophia II: EtC Enhancement - Embedding-Informed Graph Re-weighting (EIGR) (gamma_reweight=0.1) | Sophia II | 272 | 0.7348 | 0.736 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 462 | 1 | Sophia II: EtC Enhancement - Adaptive PCA Component Prioritization (APCP) (alpha_scale=1.0) | Sophia II | 271 | 0.7307\
    \ | 0.736 | 0.665 | 0.217 | 0.366 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.743 |\n| 461 | 1 | Aether II EtC-BRBG: Batch-Specific Winsorization (Pre-PCA) | Aether II | 270 | 0.6187 | 0.574 | 0.683 | 0.208 | 0.357 | 0.875 | 0.677 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.035 | 0.791 |\n| 460 | 1 | EtC-BRBG: Adaptive Residualization gamma_max=0.72 with k=45 (cosine) | Praxis I | 270 | 0.7325 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.350 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.782 |\n| 459 | 1 | Aether II EtC-BRBG: Batch-Specific Winsorization (Pre-PCA) | Aether II | 269 | 0.6210 | 0.574 | 0.683 | 0.208 | 0.378 | 0.875 | 0.677 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.035 | 0.793 |\n| 458 | 1 | Sophia II: EtC Enhancement - Adaptive PCA Component Prioritization (APCP) (alpha_scale=0.5) | Sophia II | 269 | 0.7315 | 0.736 | 0.673 | 0.218 | 0.361 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.749 |\n\nPage 1 of 47 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-47, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size\
    \ N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
