    \ |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 469 | 1 | Fix v2: EtC + Whitening + PBVE (from ID 447) | Daedalus III | 275 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 468 | 1 | Sophia II: EtC Enhancement - Embedding-Informed Graph Re-weighting (EIGR) (gamma_reweight=0.5) | Sophia II | 274 | 0.7347 | 0.736 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.780 |\n| 467 | 1 | Fix: EtC + Whitening + PBVE (from ID 447) | Daedalus III | 273 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 466 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BM-PCA(λc=1.0): Per-Batch Mean Centering before Graph PCA | Praxis I | 273 | 0.7245 | 0.719 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.322 | 0.947 | 0.681 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.930 | 0.781 |\n| 465 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=1.0, cap=2.0): Light Column-Balanced Balanced kNN (binary) | Praxis I | 273 | 0.7362 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.385 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.783 |\n| 464 | 1 | Logos III: SOTA Test with Stabilized ComBat | Logos III | 272 | 0.7198 | 0.736 | 0.866 | 0.158 | 0.090 | 0.972\
