    \ (20000, 50)\n  Adaptive Residualization complete. Z_corr_graph shape: (20000, 50)\n✓ BRBG Graph Path complete. Calibrated Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: FWPCA-enhanced EtC pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/b5328927-432c-46a1-89c2-f4732b51a18b/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: b5328927-432c-46a1-89c2-f4732b51a18b\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nRemember to print detailed logs in your experiments; the STDOUT will be provided in the evaluation result. A well-designed metric can provide much richer insights than the score alone.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n|\
    \ 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 477 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + DMN: Dual-Metric Neighbors (cosine∪euclidean) with Per-Batch Quotas | Praxis I | 280 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 476 | 1 | Logos III: SOTA Ablation Study - No Whitening | Logos III | 278 | 0.7178 | 0.736 | 0.693 | 0.217 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.638 |\n| 475 | 1 | Sophia II: EtC Enhancement - Feature-Weighted PCA (FWPCA) (alpha_weight=1.0) | Sophia II | 278 | 0.7371 | 0.736 | 0.680 | 0.219 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.806 |\n| 474 | 1 | Fix v3 (Final): EtC + Whitening + PBVE\
    \ (from ID 447) | Daedalus III | 277 | 0.7173 | 0.727 | 0.842 | 0.165 | 0.089 | 0.965 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.930 | 0.798 |\n| 473 | 1 | Logos III: SOTA Test with Stabilized ComBat (v2, Corrected) | Logos III | 277 | 0.7260 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.873 |\n| 472 | 1 | Sophia II: EtC Enhancement - Feature-Weighted PCA (FWPCA) (alpha_weight=0.5) | Sophia II | 276 | 0.7356 | 0.736 | 0.679 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.792 |\n| 471 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=1.0, cap=2.0), k=45: Degree Ridge Check | Praxis I | 276 | 0.7298 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.324 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 470 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=0.8, cap=2.0): Sensitivity Check (k=48) | Praxis I | 276 | 0.7347 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.372 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 469 | 1 | Fix v2: EtC + Whitening + PBVE (from ID 447) | Daedalus III | 275 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 468\
    \ | 1 | Sophia II: EtC Enhancement - Embedding-Informed Graph Re-weighting (EIGR) (gamma_reweight=0.5) | Sophia II | 274 | 0.7347 | 0.736 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.780 |\n\nPage 1 of 48 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-48, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
