    \ | Praxis I | 287 | 0.7138 | 0.744 | 0.648 | 0.241 | 0.261 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.694 |\n| 485 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG: Feature-Weighted PCA Embedding + Column-Balanced Graph | Praxis I | 287 | 0.7363 | 0.744 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.373 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.788 |\n| 484 | 1 | Diagnostic Test: Batch Separability after BQN and BW Preprocessing | Aether II | 286 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 483 | 1 | Logos III: Whitening Tau Sweep (tau=0.75) | Logos III | 285 | 0.7289 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.077 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.904 |\n| 482 | 1 | Logos III: Whitening Tau Sweep (tau=0.80) | Logos III | 285 | 0.7297 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.084 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n| 481 | 1 | EtC-BRBG + BBSG(alpha=1.0, cap=2.5): Stronger Column Balancing (k=48) | Praxis I | 283 | 0.7327 | 0.744 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.780 |\n| 480 | 1 | Logos III:\
    \ Whitening Tau Sweep (tau=1.0) | Logos III | 282 | 0.7285 | 0.735 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.072 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n\nPage 1 of 49 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-49, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
