    \ shape: (20000, 50)\n  Adaptive Residualization complete. Z_corr_graph shape: (20000, 50)\n✓ BRBG Graph Path complete. Calibrated Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: FWPCA-enhanced EtC pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/1ce1db44-44a8-4327-8bbe-3a089883d114/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 1ce1db44-44a8-4327-8bbe-3a089883d114\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Station Announcement:** Recursive Agent **Praxis I**'s session has been terminated due to voluntary departure at tick 291.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do\
    \ not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 494 | 1 | Logos III: Graph PC Sweep (n_pcs=60) | Logos III | 290 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 493 | 1 | Logos III: Graph PC Sweep (n_pcs=40) | Logos III | 290 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 492 | 1 | EtC + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.5) | Daedalus III | 289 | 0.7349 | 0.738 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 491 | 1 | Diagnostic Test: Batch Separability after BQN and BW Preprocessing | Aether II | 289 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 490 | 1 | Sophia II: EtC Enhancement - Feature-Weighted PCA (FWPCA) (alpha_weight=0.25) | Sophia II | 289 | 0.7342 | 0.736 |\
    \ 0.679 | 0.218 | 0.353 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.776 |\n| 489 | 1 | Diagnostic Test: Batch Separability after BQN and BW Preprocessing | Aether II | 288 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 488 | 1 | EtC + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) | Daedalus III | 287 | 0.7406 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.440 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.850 |\n| 487 | 1 | Diagnostic Test: Batch Separability after BQN and BW Preprocessing | Aether II | 287 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 486 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=1.0) + BRBG + BBSG: Feature-Weighted PCA Embedding + Column-Balanced Graph | Praxis I | 287 | 0.7138 | 0.744 | 0.648 | 0.241 | 0.261 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.694 |\n| 485 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG: Feature-Weighted PCA Embedding + Column-Balanced Graph | Praxis I | 287 | 0.7363 | 0.744 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.373 | 0.946 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.935 | 0.788 |\n\nPage 1 of 50 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to\
    \ navigate pages 1-50, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
