    \n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 519 | 1 | Logos III: Novel 'Refinement Architecture' Test (alpha=0.3) | Logos III | 308 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 518 | 1 | Ablation D1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5, PCA80) + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 307 | 0.7175 | 0.725 | 0.693 | 0.236 | 0.349 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.693 |\n| 517 | 1 | Ablation N3: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + ComBat + PC whitening + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 307 | 0.7067 | 0.725 | 0.800 | 0.163 | 0.114 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.784 |\n| 516 | 1 | Logos III: Novel 'Refinement Architecture' Test (alpha=0.1) | Logos III | 307 | 0.7422 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.458 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.849 |\n| 515 | 1 | Aether II Synergy: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5)\
    \ + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) | Aether II | 307 | 0.7414 | 0.738 | 0.664 | 0.111 | 0.463 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.859 |\n| 514 | 1 | Ablation N2: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5 × batch-R2 gene penalty β=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 306 | 0.7160 | 0.725 | 0.663 | 0.248 | 0.316 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.728 |\n| 513 | 1 | Sophia II: Replication - Daedalus III's EtC SOTA (ID 488) v2 with sklearn.Ridge Fix (lam=0.7) | Sophia II | 306 | 0.7313 | 0.738 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.315 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 512 | 1 | Ablation N1: EtC(BRS + FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 305 | 0.7218 | 0.725 | 0.681 | 0.245 | 0.299 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.788 |\n| 511 | 1 | Logos III: Replication of Daedalus III SOTA (ID 488) | Logos III | 305 | 0.7404 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.440 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.849 |\n| 510 | 1 | Ablation R3: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(lam=0.85) + BBSG\
    \ (binary) | Praxis II | 304 | 0.7229 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 52 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-52, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**logos/daedalus_sota_replication.py:**\n```\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/Daedalus')\n\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy import sparse as sp\nfrom sklearn.decomposition import TruncatedSVD\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import Ridge\n\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis')\nfrom brbg_common import _pca_truncated_svd as praxis_pca, _one_hot_batches as praxis_one_hot, _build_balanced_knn_equal\n\ndef _ridge_batch_fit_predict_per_pc(B, Z, l2=1e-3):\n    model = Ridge(alpha=l2, fit_intercept=False, random_state=0)\n    model.fit(B, Z)\n    Z_hat = model.predict(B)\n   \
    \ ss_res = np.sum((Z - Z_hat)**2, axis=0)\n    ss_tot = np.sum((Z - Z.mean(axis=0))**2, axis=0)\n    r2_per_pc = 1 - ss_res / (ss_tot + 1e-8)\n    return Z_hat, np.clip(r2_per_pc, 0, 1)\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    adata_for_embedding = adata.copy()\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata_for_embedding, target_sum=1e-4)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata_for_embedding)\n    sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata_for_embedding, n_top_genes=2000, batch_key='batch', flavor='seurat_v3', subset=True)\n    sc.pp.pca(adata_for_embedding, n_comps=60)\n    \n    pca_adata = ad.AnnData(X=adata_for_embedding.obsm['X_pca'], obs=adata_for_embedding.obs)\n    sc.pp.combat(pca_adata, key='batch')\n    Z_emb = pca_adata.X\n    \n    adata_for_graph = adata.copy()\n    n_pcs_graph=50; gamma_max=0.74; l2=1e-3; k_total=48; metric='cosine'; random_state=0\n    lam=0.7 \n    \n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata_for_graph, target_sum=1e4)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata_for_graph)\n\n    sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata_for_graph,\
    \ n_top_genes=2000, batch_key='batch', flavor='seurat_v3', subset=False)\n    hvg_mask = adata_for_graph.var['highly_variable']\n    X_graph = adata_for_graph.X[:, hvg_mask]\n    \n    Z_graph = praxis_pca(X_graph, n_comps=n_pcs_graph, random_state=random_state)\n    \n    batches = np.asarray(adata_for_graph.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n    B_onehot, _ = praxis_one_hot(batches)\n    \n    Z_hat, r2_per_pc = _ridge_batch_fit_predict_per_pc(B_onehot, Z_graph, l2=l2)\n    gamma_per_pc = np.minimum(gamma_max, lam * r2_per_pc)\n    Z_corr_graph = Z_graph - (gamma_per_pc * Z_hat)\n    \n    C, D = _build_balanced_knn_equal(Z_corr_graph, batches, k_total=k_total, metric=metric)\n    \n    adata_out = ad.AnnData(obs=adata.obs[[]], var=adata.var[[]], obsm={'X_emb': Z_emb})\n    if C is not None and D is not None:\n        if not sp.isspmatrix_csr(C): C = C.tocsr()\n        if not sp.isspmatrix_csr(D): D = D.tocsr()\n        adata_out.obsp['connectivities'] = C\n        adata_out.obsp['distances']\
    \ = D\n        adata_out.uns['neighbors'] = {'connectivities_key': 'connectivities', 'distances_key': 'distances'}\n        \n    return adata_out\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
