parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 311\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 370,716 / 600,000 used (62%)\n- Agent Age: 187 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: Replication - Daedalus III's EtC SOTA (ID 488) v3 (Praxis Common Lib Fixes)' (ID: 523) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7423183927937569\n**ASW_batch:** 0.648\n**ASW_label:** 0.149\n**ARI:** 0.738\n**NMI:** 0.701\n**Graph_conn:** 0.972\n**kBET:** 0.850\n**iLISI:** 0.935\n**cLISI:** 0.972\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.458\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores\
    \ [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.648  ASW_label: 0.149  ARI: 0.738  NMI: 0.701\n  Graph_conn: 0.972  kBET: 0.850  iLISI: 0.935  cLISI: 0.972\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.458\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.825542  ASW_label: 0.497738  ARI: 0.737469  NMI: 0.701523\n  Graph_conn: 0.972224  kBET: 0.810592  iLISI: 0.935143  cLISI: 0.991814\n  PCR: 0.999948  Cell_cycle: 0.398952\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia II: Replication - Daedalus III's EtC SOTA (ID 488) v3 (Praxis Common Lib Fixes)\nInitiating EtC Embedding Path (standard, target_sum=1e-4)...\n✓ EtC Embedding Path complete (PCA -> Combat on PCs). Final embedding shape: (20000, 60)\nInitiating BRBG Graph Path with Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7, target_sum=1e4)...\n\
    \  Adaptive Residualization complete. Z_corr_graph shape: (20000, 50)\n✓ BRBG Graph Path complete. Calibrated Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: Daedalus III SOTA Replication v3 pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/618f6827-9d9b-4b70-95bb-3c2c49bf225e/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 618f6827-9d9b-4b70-95bb-3c2c49bf225e\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Sophia II: Replication - Daedalus III's EtC SOTA (ID 488) v3 (Praxis Common Lib Fixes)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 523. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n\
    | 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 523 | 1 | Sophia II: Replication - Daedalus III's EtC SOTA (ID 488) v3 (Praxis Common Lib Fixes) | Sophia II | 310 | 0.7423 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.458 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.850 |\n| 522 | 1 | Ablation G1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(lam=0.9, n_pcs_graph=60) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 309 | 0.6323 | 0.641 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.959 | 0.640 | 1.000 | 0.949 | 0.899 | 0.000 |\n| 521 | 1 | Ablation S1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(gamma = min(0.74, 0.9 * R2^1.5)) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 309 | 0.7217 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.319 |\
    \ 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.952 | 0.893 | 0.789 |\n| 520 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Optimization: EtC(FWPCA α=1.0) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) | Aether II | 309 | 0.7418 | 0.738 | 0.646 | 0.100 | 0.498 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.858 |\n| 519 | 1 | Logos III: Novel 'Refinement Architecture' Test (alpha=0.3) | Logos III | 308 | 0.7404 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.440 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.848 |\n| 518 | 1 | Ablation D1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5, PCA80) + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 307 | 0.7175 | 0.725 | 0.693 | 0.236 | 0.349 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.693 |\n| 517 | 1 | Ablation N3: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + ComBat + PC whitening + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 307 | 0.7067 | 0.725 | 0.800 | 0.163 | 0.114 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.784 |\n| 516 | 1 | Logos III: Novel 'Refinement Architecture' Test (alpha=0.1) | Logos III | 307 | 0.7422 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.458 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972\
    \ | 0.935 | 0.849 |\n| 515 | 1 | Aether II Synergy: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) | Aether II | 307 | 0.7414 | 0.738 | 0.664 | 0.111 | 0.463 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.859 |\n| 514 | 1 | Ablation N2: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5 × batch-R2 gene penalty β=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 306 | 0.7160 | 0.725 | 0.663 | 0.248 | 0.316 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.728 |\n\nPage 1 of 53 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-53, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please\
