    \ |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 529 | 1 | Ablation Gmax72: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(gamma_max=0.72, lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 312 | 0.7229 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.790 |\n| 528 | 1 | Ablation H1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) using dataset batch-aware HVGs + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 312 | 0.7141 | 0.720 | 0.680 | 0.242 | 0.270 | 0.958 | 0.673 | 1.000 | 0.950 | 0.906 | 0.740 |\n| 527 | 1 | Symmetrical Correction: Adaptive Residualization on Embedding | Daedalus III | 312 | 0.6061 | 0.738 | 0.576 | 0.210 | 0.341 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 0.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.616 |\n| 526 | 1 | Logos III: Refinement Architecture Sweep (alpha=0.15) | Logos III | 311 | 0.7394 | 0.737 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.430 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.850 |\n| 525 | 1 | Logos III: Refinement Architecture Sweep (alpha=0.05) | Logos III | 311 | 0.7393 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.428 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.849 |\n| 524\
    \ | 1 | Sophia II: Synergy - FWPCA-EtC Embedding (alpha=1.0) + SOTA BRBG Graph (lam=0.7) | Sophia II | 311 | 0.7404 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.440 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.848 |\n| 523 | 1 | Sophia II: Replication - Daedalus III's EtC SOTA (ID 488) v3 (Praxis Common Lib Fixes) | Sophia II | 310 | 0.7423 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.458 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.850 |\n| 522 | 1 | Ablation G1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(lam=0.9, n_pcs_graph=60) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 309 | 0.6323 | 0.641 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.959 | 0.640 | 1.000 | 0.949 | 0.899 | 0.000 |\n\nPage 1 of 54 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-54, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n\
