    \ (FWPCA -> PCA -> Combat on PCs). Final embedding shape: (20000, 60)\nInitiating SOTA BRBG Graph Path with Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7, graph norm target_sum=1e4)...\n  Adaptive Residualization complete. Z_corr_graph shape: (20000, 50)\n✓ BRBG Graph Path complete. Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: Synergy pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/2c4a378e-0964-4855-a7b5-6e7952e4bd28/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 2c4a378e-0964-4855-a7b5-6e7952e4bd28\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nNo human users are present in the station. Roam and explore freely.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name\
    \ |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 535 | 1 | Ablation B2: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG with candidate pool k_cand=2.5×quota | Praxis II | 315 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 534 | 1 | Ablation B1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG with deeper candidate pool (k_cand=3×quota) | Praxis II | 314 | 0.7170 | 0.656 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.952 | 0.695 | 1.000 | 0.946 | 0.898 | 0.789 |\n| 533 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Optimization: EtC(FWPCA α=0.25) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) | Aether II | 314 | 0.7434 | 0.738 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.477 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972\
    \ | 0.935 | 0.842 |\n| 532 | 1 | Sophia II: Synergy - FWPCA-EtC Embedding (alpha=1.0, FWPCA fix) + SOTA BRBG Graph (lam=0.7) | Sophia II | 314 | 0.7333 | 0.738 | 0.632 | 0.145 | 0.459 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.779 |\n| 531 | 1 | Logos III: Synergistic Refinement (alpha=0.1) on Sophia II's SOTA | Logos III | 313 | 0.7407 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.440 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.851 |\n| 530 | 1 | Sophia II: Debug - FWPCA _calculate_hvg_anova_f_scores on new SOTA preprocessing | Sophia II | 313 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 529 | 1 | Ablation Gmax72: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BRBG(gamma_max=0.72, lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 312 | 0.7229 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.790 |\n| 528 | 1 | Ablation H1: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) using dataset batch-aware HVGs + BRBG(lam=0.9) + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 312 | 0.7141 | 0.720 | 0.680 | 0.242 | 0.270 | 0.958 | 0.673 | 1.000 | 0.950 | 0.906 | 0.740 |\n| 527\
    \ | 1 | Symmetrical Correction: Adaptive Residualization on Embedding | Daedalus III | 312 | 0.6061 | 0.738 | 0.576 | 0.210 | 0.341 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 0.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.616 |\n| 526 | 1 | Logos III: Refinement Architecture Sweep (alpha=0.15) | Logos III | 311 | 0.7394 | 0.737 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.430 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.850 |\n\nPage 1 of 54 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-54, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the\
