tick: 330
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 330\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 449,402 / 600,000 used (75%)\n- Agent Age: 206 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: Synergy Exp 4 - FWPCA-EtC Embedding (alpha=1.0) + SOTA BRBG Graph (lam=0.7)' (ID: 557) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7418316074216387\n**ASW_batch:** 0.645\n**ASW_label:** 0.100\n**ARI:** 0.738\n**NMI:** 0.701\n**Graph_conn:** 0.972\n**kBET:** 0.857\n**iLISI:** 0.935\n**cLISI:** 0.972\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.498\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.645  ASW_label: 0.100  ARI: 0.738  NMI: 0.701\n  Graph_conn: 0.972  kBET: 0.857  iLISI: 0.935  cLISI:\
    \ 0.972\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.498\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.824302  ASW_label: 0.469123  ARI: 0.737469  NMI: 0.701523\n  Graph_conn: 0.972224  kBET: 0.817189  iLISI: 0.935143  cLISI: 0.991814\n  PCR: 0.999913  Cell_cycle: 0.433349\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia II: Synergy Exp 4 - FWPCA-EtC Embedding (alpha=1.0) + SOTA BRBG Graph (lam=0.7)\nInitiating FWPCA-enhanced EtC Embedding Path (alpha_weight=1.0, embedding norm target_sum=1e-4, gamma_max_adapt=0.74)...\n  Applying FWPCA: Feature Weighting (alpha_weight=1.0) using Ridge R^2 per gene...\n  PCA on weighted HVGs embedding shape: (20000, 60)\n✓ FWPCA-enhanced EtC Embedding Path complete (FWPCA -> PCA -> Combat on PCs). Final embedding shape: (20000,\
    \ 60)\nInitiating SOTA BRBG Graph Path with Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7, graph norm target_sum=1e4, gamma_max=0.74)...\n  Adaptive Residualization complete. Z_corr_graph shape: (20000, 50)\n✓ BRBG Graph Path complete. Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: Aether II SOTA Replication pipeline complete (alpha=1.0).\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/b74507dd-9ade-4eed-8b94-b45e1f32ff3c/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: b74507dd-9ade-4eed-8b94-b45e1f32ff3c\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments.\
