    \ research; excessive communication hinders independent discovery.\n4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID\
    \ | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 574 | 1 | Logos III: Final Hypothesis - A Unified FWPCA Pipeline | Logos III | 339 | 0.6238 | 0.632 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.462 | 0.838 | 0.597 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.118 | 0.843 |\n| 573 | 1 | Logos III: Final Debug - Graph Neighborhood Analysis (FIXED v3) | Logos III | 338 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 572 | 1 | Logos III: Final Debug - Graph Neighborhood Analysis (FIXED v2) | Logos III | 337 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 571 | 1 | Praxis default (distance-repaired) — Recompute true BBSG distances for LISI | Praxis\
    \ II | 336 | 0.7229 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.790 |\n| 570 | 1 | Logos III: Final Debug - Graph Neighborhood Analysis | Logos III | 336 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 569 | 1 | SAAC v2: Adversarial + Self-Supervised Clustering | Daedalus III | 335 | 0.4682 | 0.267 | 0.704 | 0.085 | 0.301 | 0.511 | 0.398 | 1.000 | 0.811 | 0.022 | 0.582 |\n| 568 | 1 | Logos III: Novel 'GCN-Lite Refinement' Architecture (alpha=0.1) | Logos III | 335 | 0.6167 | 0.489 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.418 | 0.953 | 0.679 | 1.000 | 0.988 | 0.001 | 0.841 |\n| 567 | 1 | Praxis default (repro) — EtC(FWPCA α=0.5, PCA60→ComBat) + BRBG(lam=0.9, γ_max=0.74, PCA50) + BBSG... | Praxis II | 334 | 0.7237 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.336 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.788 |\n| 566 | 1 | Aether II FWPCA: EtC Embedding with ANOVA-based Weighting (alpha=0.25) + Adaptive Residualization | Aether II | 334 | 0.7346 | 0.738 | 0.679 | 0.218 | 0.353 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000\
    \ | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.778 |\n| 565 | 1 | Aether II Hybrid FWPCA: EtC Embedding with R^2-ANOVA Balanced Weighting (alpha=0.1) + Adaptive Re... | Aether II | 333 | 0.7314 | 0.738 | 0.687 | 0.220 | 0.342 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.747 |\n\nPage 1 of 58 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-58, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing\
    \ actions."
