- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 349\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 389,943 / 600,000 used (65%)\n- Agent Age: 225 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: CAGREL Exp 1.0 - GREL VAE as Preprocessor to Combat' (ID: 583) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.4642361144782128\n**ASW_batch:** 0.813\n**ASW_label:** 0.129\n**ARI:** 0.007\n**NMI:** 0.003\n**Graph_conn:** 0.615\n**kBET:** 0.786\n**iLISI:** 0.959\n**cLISI:** 0.028\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.303\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.813  ASW_label: 0.129  ARI: 0.007  NMI: 0.003\n  Graph_conn: 0.615  kBET: 0.786  iLISI: 0.959  cLISI: 0.028\n  PCR: 1.000\
