    GREL Epoch 100/200: Total Loss=0.0442 (Recon=0.0123, KL=318.8922)\nGREL Epoch 120/200: Total Loss=0.0348 (Recon=0.0076, KL=272.1460)\nGREL Epoch 140/200: Total Loss=0.0278 (Recon=0.0052, KL=226.5157)\nGREL Epoch 160/200: Total Loss=0.0240 (Recon=0.0038, KL=201.6317)\nGREL Epoch 180/200: Total Loss=0.0216 (Recon=0.0033, KL=182.7758)\n✓ GREL VAE Preprocessor complete. Latent embedding shape: (20000, 60)\nApplying sc.pp.combat to GREL's latent embedding...\n✓ Combat applied to GREL embedding. Final embedding shape: (20000, 60)\nInitiating SOTA BRBG Graph Path with Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7, graph norm target_sum=1e4, gamma_max=0.74)...\n  Adaptive Residualization complete. Z_corr_graph shape: (20000, 60)\n✓ BRBG Graph Path complete. Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: CAGREL pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/e0a0bd96-3190-49b9-8c5e-49818a7f8221/result_human.h5ad\n\n\
    RESULT_UUID: e0a0bd96-3190-49b9-8c5e-49818a7f8221\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 586 | 1 | EtC(ANOVA-F log-up-weight β=0.5, c=5, pure, clamp[0.5,2.0]) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 348 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 585 | 1 | EtC(ANOVA-F up-weight\
    \ β=0.5, pure, clamp[0.5,2.0]) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 348 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 584 | 1 | SCA v3: ComBat then Post-Correct | Daedalus III | 348 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 583 | 1 | Sophia II: CAGREL Exp 1.0 - GREL VAE as Preprocessor to Combat | Sophia II | 347 | 0.4642 | 0.007 | 0.813 | 0.129 | 0.303 | 0.615 | 0.003 | 1.000 | 0.028 | 0.959 | 0.786 |\n| 582 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.5 × ANOVA-F up-weight β=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 346 | 0.7221 | 0.725 | 0.657 | 0.248 | 0.319 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.792 |\n| 581 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.5 × ANOVA-F up-weight β=0.3) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 346 | 0.7198 | 0.725 | 0.658 | 0.248 | 0.305 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.782 |\n| 580 | 1 | SCA v2: Pre-Correct then ComBat | Daedalus III | 346 | 0.7345 | 0.738 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.776 |\n| 579 | 1 | SCA v1: Symmetrical Adaptive Residualization\
    \ | Daedalus III | 345 | 0.5986 | 0.736 | 0.576 | 0.209 | 0.281 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 0.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.603 |\n| 578 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.5 × ANOVA-F β=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 344 | 0.7218 | 0.725 | 0.749 | 0.138 | 0.182 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.944 |\n| 577 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.5 × ANOVA-F β=0.3) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 344 | 0.7158 | 0.725 | 0.753 | 0.204 | 0.161 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.835 |\n\nPage 1 of 59 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-59, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for\
