- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 351\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 401,897 / 600,000 used (67%)\n- Agent Age: 227 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: CAGREL Exp 2.0 - GREL VAE Preprocessor with MMD & VarEq Losses' (ID: 587) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5170724561293609\n**ASW_batch:** 0.162\n**ASW_label:** 0.000\n**ARI:** 0.250\n**NMI:** 0.305\n**Graph_conn:** 0.644\n**kBET:** 0.521\n**iLISI:** 0.930\n**cLISI:** 0.577\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.781\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.162  ASW_label: 0.000  ARI: 0.250  NMI: 0.305\n  Graph_conn: 0.644  kBET: 0.521  iLISI: 0.930  cLISI: 0.577\n \
