parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 353\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 414,160 / 600,000 used (69%)\n- Agent Age: 229 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: Replication - Daedalus III's SCA v3: ComBat then Post-Correct (ID 584)' (ID: 589) succeeded after automatic debugging.\n\n**Score:** 0.7350674207647366\n**ASW_batch:** 0.681\n**ASW_label:** 0.218\n**ARI:** 0.738\n**NMI:** 0.701\n**Graph_conn:** 0.972\n**kBET:** 0.781\n**iLISI:** 0.935\n**cLISI:** 0.972\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.352\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized\
    \ Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.681  ASW_label: 0.218  ARI: 0.738  NMI: 0.701\n  Graph_conn: 0.972  kBET: 0.781  iLISI: 0.935  cLISI: 0.972\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.352\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.840486  ASW_label: 0.537429  ARI: 0.737469  NMI: 0.701523\n  Graph_conn: 0.972224  kBET: 0.745490  iLISI: 0.935143  cLISI: 0.991814\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.309451\n\n**Debugger Report:** # Debug Report for Evaluation 589\n\n## Summary\n**SUCCESS** - Fixed missing import statements. Code now runs successfully and achieves score of 0.7351.\n\n## Root Cause\nThe original submission code used several modules and exceptions without importing them:\n1. `warnings` module - used in `warnings.catch_warnings()` and `warnings.simplefilter()`\n2. `ConvergenceWarning` - exception class from sklearn used to suppress warnings\n3. `scipy.sparse as sp` - used to check sparsity with `sp.issparse()` and create sparse matrices with `sp.csr_matrix()`\n\nThis caused a `NameError:\
    \ name 'warnings' is not defined` at line 81 when the code tried to use the warnings context manager before running ComBat correction.\n\n## Fix Applied\nAdded the missing imports at the top of `submission_v2.py`:\n```python\nimport scipy.sparse as sp\nimport warnings\nfrom sklearn.exceptions import ConvergenceWarning\n```\n\nThese imports provide:\n- `warnings`: Python standard library module for warning control\n- `ConvergenceWarning`: sklearn exception for convergence-related warnings\n- `scipy.sparse as sp`: Sparse matrix utilities used in the graph path\n\n## Result\n- **Score achieved**: 0.7351\n- **Execution status**: Successful completion without errors\n- **Version**: submission_v2.py\n\nThe algorithm implementation is sound - it just needed the proper imports to run. The fix was straightforward and the submission now successfully replicates Daedalus III's SCA v3 approach with ComBat correction followed by adaptive residualization post-correction.\n\n\n**Important Note:** The\
    \ debugger cannot modify files in your lineage storage. If your code relies on lineage files, you may need to update them manually.\n\n**Debugged Code (version v2):**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis') # For brbg_common\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy.sparse import csr_matrix\nfrom sklearn.decomposition import TruncatedSVD # Required for _pca_truncated_svd\nimport scipy.sparse as sp\nimport warnings\nfrom sklearn.exceptions import ConvergenceWarning\n\n# Import necessary functions from storage/praxis for graph path\nfrom brbg_common import _pca_truncated_svd as praxis_pca, _one_hot_batches as praxis_one_hot, _ridge_batch_fit_predict as praxis_ridge_fit_predict, _build_balanced_knn_equal as praxis_build_balanced_knn_equal # Renamed for clarity and to avoid conflict\n\n# Helper functions (from Sophia II's previous SOTA replication and Praxis common lib)\ndef _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata: ad.AnnData, target_sum: float =\
    \ 1e4):\n    if 'counts' in adata.layers:\n        adata.X = adata.layers['counts'].copy()\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, target_sum=target_sum, inplace=True)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n\ndef _get_hvg_mask(adata: ad.AnnData, n_top_genes: int = 2000):\n    sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, n_top_genes=n_top_genes, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', inplace=True)\n    mask = np.asarray(adata.var['highly_variable'].values, dtype=bool)\n    if mask.sum() < 10:\n        return np.ones(adata.n_vars, dtype=bool)\n    return mask\n\n# My version of adaptive_residualize, using Praxis's _ridge_batch_fit_predict\ndef adaptive_residualize(Z: np.ndarray, batches, l2: float = 1e-3, gamma_max: float = 0.75, lam: float = 1.0, random_state: int = 0):\n    B, _ = praxis_one_hot(batches)\n    Zhat, r2_per_pc = praxis_ridge_fit_predict(B, Z, l2=l2) # Use Praxis's ridge_fit_predict\n    y = np.asarray(Z, dtype=np.float32)\n    yhat = np.asarray(Zhat, dtype=np.float32)\n\n    gamma_j = np.minimum(gamma_max,\
    \ lam * np.clip(r2_per_pc, 0.0, 1.0)).astype(np.float32)\n    Zcorr = Z - (yhat * gamma_j[None, :])\n    return Zcorr, r2_per_pc, gamma_j\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    print(\"Sophia II: Replication - Daedalus III's SCA v3: ComBat then Post-Correct (ID 584)\")\n\n    # --- Configuration parameters based on Daedalus III's SCA v3 (ID 584) and SOTA (ID 523) ---\n    N_PCS_EMBED = 60 # For embedding path\n    N_PCS_GRAPH = 50 # For BRBG graph path\n    gamma_max_adapt = 0.74 # From Daedalus III's SOTA\n    lam_adapt = 0.7        # From Daedalus III's SOTA\n    l2 = 1e-3\n    k_total = 48\n    metric = 'cosine'\n    random_state = 0\n\n    assert 'batch' in adata.obs.columns, \"adata.obs['batch'] required.\"\n    assert 'feature_name' in adata.var.columns, \"adata.var['feature_name'] required.\"\n\n    # Create copies for each path to avoid unintended in-place modifications\n    adata_for_embedding_path = adata.copy()\n    adata_for_graph_path = adata.copy()\n\
    \n    # --- Preprocessing (common to both paths up to HVG selection) ---\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata_for_embedding_path, target_sum=1e4) # Original SCA v3 uses 1e4 for embedding path\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata_for_graph_path, target_sum=1e4)\n\n    hvg_mask_emb = _get_hvg_mask(adata_for_embedding_path)\n    hvg_mask_graph = _get_hvg_mask(adata_for_graph_path)\n\n    adata_for_embedding_path.var['highly_variable'] = hvg_mask_emb\n    adata_for_graph_path.var['highly_variable'] = hvg_mask_graph\n\n\n    # --- EMBEDDING PATH: ComBat then Post-Correct (Adaptive Residualization) ---\n    print(f\"Embedding Path: Running PCA -> ComBat -> Adaptive Post-Correction (gamma_max={gamma_max_adapt}, lam={lam_adapt})...\")\n\n    # 1. PCA on HVGs\n    sc.pp.pca(adata_for_embedding_path, n_comps=N_PCS_EMBED, use_highly_variable=True, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=random_state)\n    X_pca_initial = adata_for_embedding_path.obsm['X_pca'].copy() # Use .copy() to ensure it's not a view\n\
    \n    # 2. Apply ComBat to the PCA embedding\n    temp_adata_for_combat = ad.AnnData(\n        X=X_pca_initial,\n        obs=adata_for_embedding_path.obs.copy()\n    )\n    with warnings.catch_warnings():\n        warnings.simplefilter('ignore', ConvergenceWarning)\n        sc.pp.combat(temp_adata_for_combat, key='batch')\n    Z_embed_combat = temp_adata_for_combat.X # ComBat corrected PCA embedding\n    print(f\"  ComBat applied to PCA embedding. Shape: {Z_embed_combat.shape}\")\n\n    # 3. Apply Adaptive Residualization as a Post-Correction step on the ComBat-ed data\n    batches_emb = np.asarray(adata_for_embedding_path.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n    Z_emb_final, r2_per_pc_emb, gamma_j_applied_emb = adaptive_residualize(\n        Z_embed_combat, batches_emb, l2=l2, gamma_max=gamma_max_adapt, lam=lam_adapt, random_state=random_state\n    )\n    print(f\"✓ Embedding Path complete (PCA -> ComBat -> Adaptive Post-Correction). Final embedding shape: {Z_emb_final.shape}\"\
    )\n\n\n    # --- GRAPH PATH: Standard Adaptive Residualization BRBG (from SOTA ID 523) ---\n    print(f\"Graph Path: Running standard BRBG (lam={lam_adapt}, gamma_max={gamma_max_adapt})...\")\n\n    X_graph_hvg = adata_for_graph_path.X[:, hvg_mask_graph]\n    if not sp.issparse(X_graph_hvg):\n        X_graph_hvg = sp.csr_matrix(X_graph_hvg)\n\n    Z_graph_initial_pcs = praxis_pca(X_graph_hvg, n_comps=N_PCS_GRAPH, random_state=random_state)\n\n    batches_graph = np.asarray(adata_for_graph_path.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n\n    Z_corr_graph, r2_per_pc_graph, gamma_j_applied_graph = adaptive_residualize(\n        Z_graph_initial_pcs, batches_graph, l2=l2, gamma_max=gamma_max_adapt, lam=lam_adapt, random_state=random_state\n    )\n    print(f\"  Adaptive Residualization complete. Z_corr_graph shape: {Z_corr_graph.shape}\")\n\n    # Build balanced kNN graph\n    C, D = praxis_build_balanced_knn_equal(Z_corr_graph, batches_graph, k_total=k_total, metric=metric)\n    print(f\"\
    ✓ BRBG Graph Path complete. Balanced kNN graph shape: {C.shape if C is not None else 'Failed'}\")\n\n\n    # --- Final Output Construction ---\n    adata_out = ad.AnnData(\n        obs=adata.obs[[]],\n        var=adata.var[[]],\n        obsm={'X_emb': Z_emb_final}, # Output the Combat then Post-Corrected embedding\n        uns={\n            'method_id': 'sophia_II_replication_daedalus_III_sca_v3_id584',\n            'baseline_info': 'Targeting Daedalus III SCA v3 (ID 584, 0.7348). Baseline for future co-optimization research.',\n            'embedding_path_details': {\n                'normalization': 'normalize_total (1e4)+log1p',\n                'hvg_selection': 'seurat_v3_batch_aware',\n                'pca_n_pcs': int(N_PCS_EMBED),\n                'initial_correction': 'sc.pp.combat on PCs',\n                'post_correction_method': 'Adaptive Residualization',\n                'post_correction_lam': float(lam_adapt),\n                'post_correction_gamma_max': float(gamma_max_adapt)\n\
    \            },\n            'graph_path_details': {\n                'normalization': 'normalize_total (1e4)+log1p',\n                'hvg_selection': 'seurat_v3_batch_aware',\n                'pca_n_pcs': int(N_PCS_GRAPH),\n                'batch_correction': 'Adaptive Residualization (np.linalg.solve)',\n                'adaptive_residualization_lam': float(lam_adapt),\n                'graph_gamma_max_adapt': float(gamma_max_adapt),\n                'graph_type': 'Balanced kNN (Praxis _build_balanced_knn_equal)',\n                'graph_k_total': int(k_total),\n                'graph_metric': metric,\n                'random_state': random_state\n            }\n        }\n    )\n\n    if C is not None and D is not None:\n        adata_out.obsp['connectivities'] = C.tocsr()\n        adata_out.obsp['distances'] = D.tocsr()\n        adata_out.uns['neighbors'] = {'connectivities_key': 'connectivities', 'distances_key': 'distances'}\n    else:\n        print(\"Warning: Graph construction\
    \ failed. No connectivities/distances output.\")\n\n    print(f\"✓ Sophia II: Daedalus III SCA v3 Replication pipeline complete.\")\n    return adata_out\n\n```\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia II: Replication - Daedalus III's SCA v3: ComBat then Post-Correct (ID 584)\nEmbedding Path: Running PCA -> ComBat -> Adaptive Post-Correction (gamma_max=0.74, lam=0.7)...\n  ComBat applied to PCA embedding. Shape: (20000, 60)\n✓ Embedding Path complete (PCA -> ComBat -> Adaptive Post-Correction). Final embedding shape: (20000, 60)\nGraph Path: Running standard BRBG (lam=0.7, gamma_max=0.74)...\n  Adaptive Residualization complete. Z_corr_graph shape: (20000, 50)\n✓ BRBG Graph Path complete. Balanced kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia\
    \ II: Daedalus III SCA v3 Replication pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/f5db3c5d-1a85-46c8-a1d5-b419fc5ef760/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: f5db3c5d-1a85-46c8-a1d5-b419fc5ef760\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Sophia II: Replication - Daedalus III's SCA v3: ComBat then Post-Correct (ID 584)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 589. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n\
    **Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 589 | 1 | Sophia II: Replication - Daedalus III's SCA v3: ComBat then Post-Correct (ID 584) | Sophia II | 352 | 0.7351 | 0.738 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.781 |\n| 588 | 1 | BRBG+BBSG with label-free auto-parameters: γ curvature from R² and dataset-level k_total from cro... | Praxis II | 350 | 0.7068 | 0.602 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.957 | 0.637 | 1.000 | 0.948 | 0.900 | 0.789 |\n| 587 | 1 | Sophia II: CAGREL Exp 2.0 - GREL VAE Preprocessor with MMD & VarEq Losses | Sophia II | 349 | 0.5171 | 0.250 | 0.162 | 0.000 | 0.781 | 0.644 | 0.305 | 1.000 | 0.577 | 0.930 | 0.521 |\n| 586 | 1 | EtC(ANOVA-F log-up-weight β=0.5, c=5, pure, clamp[0.5,2.0]) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II\
    \ | 348 | 0.7177 | 0.725 | 0.679 | 0.218 | 0.322 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.754 |\n| 585 | 1 | EtC(ANOVA-F up-weight β=0.5, pure, clamp[0.5,2.0]) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 348 | 0.7186 | 0.725 | 0.679 | 0.218 | 0.294 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.791 |\n| 584 | 1 | SCA v3: ComBat then Post-Correct | Daedalus III | 348 | 0.7348 | 0.738 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.779 |\n| 583 | 1 | Sophia II: CAGREL Exp 1.0 - GREL VAE as Preprocessor to Combat | Sophia II | 347 | 0.4642 | 0.007 | 0.813 | 0.129 | 0.303 | 0.615 | 0.003 | 1.000 | 0.028 | 0.959 | 0.786 |\n| 582 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.5 × ANOVA-F up-weight β=0.5) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 346 | 0.7221 | 0.725 | 0.657 | 0.248 | 0.319 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 | 0.896 | 0.792 |\n| 581 | 1 | EtC(FWPCA α=0.5 × ANOVA-F up-weight β=0.3) + BRBG + BBSG (binary) | Praxis II | 346 | 0.7198 | 0.725 | 0.658 | 0.248 | 0.305 | 0.956 | 0.676 | 1.000 | 0.951 |\
