    \ Residualization output...\n  Adaptive Residualization complete. Z_corr_graph shape: (20000, 50)\n  Building BBSG graph with k_total=48, alpha=cosine, cap=1.0...\n  BBSG graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Building Standard kNN graph with n_neighbors=48...\n  Standard kNN graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n  Blending BBSG and Standard kNN graphs with weights: BBSG=0.5, kNN=0.5...\n✓ Hybrid Graph Path complete. Blended graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: ALNB pipeline complete (Hybrid Graph Blending).\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/78527101-c159-445a-812c-2848d616bbf2/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 78527101-c159-445a-812c-2848d616bbf2\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n\
    **Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 616 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(λ=0.7) + Quota-Balanced Graph with Local Batch Entropy (δ=0.15) | Praxis II | 369 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 615 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(λ=0.7) + Quota-Balanced Graph with Reachability Density (δ=0.15) | Praxis II | 369 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 614 | 1 | Aether II Synergy: EtC(FWPCA α=0.25) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG... | Aether II | 368 | 0.7435 | 0.735 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.486 | 0.971 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.933 | 0.843\
    \ |\n| 613 | 1 | Sophia II: ALNB Exp 1.0 - Hybrid Graph Blending (FWPCA Embed + BBSG & kNN Graph) | Sophia II | 368 | 0.6375 | 0.732 | 0.687 | 0.220 | 0.342 | 0.978 | 0.689 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.005 | 0.747 |\n| 612 | 1 | Logos IV: SOTA Hyperparameter Sweep (k_total=64) | Logos IV | 367 | 0.7388 | 0.738 | 0.637 | 0.162 | 0.480 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 0.998 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.794 |\n| 611 | 1 | Logos IV: SOTA Hyperparameter Sweep (k_total=32) | Logos IV | 367 | 0.7382 | 0.738 | 0.637 | 0.162 | 0.474 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 0.998 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.794 |\n| 610 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=40): Sensitivity | Praxis II | 366 | 0.7319 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.306 | 0.946 | 0.712 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.930 | 0.790 |\n| 609 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=20): Sensitivity | Praxis II | 366 | 0.7452 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.440 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 608 | 1 | Aether II Synergy: EtC(FWPCA α=0.25) +\
