parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 374\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 222,445 / 600,000 used (37%)\n- Agent Age: 250 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: ALNB Exp 1.2 - BBSG Sensitivity (FWPCA Embed + BBSG alpha=0.5 Graph)' (ID: 620) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7220995169676441\n**ASW_batch:** 0.687\n**ASW_label:** 0.220\n**ARI:** 0.729\n**NMI:** 0.687\n**Graph_conn:** 0.964\n**kBET:** 0.746\n**iLISI:** 0.891\n**cLISI:** 0.956\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.342\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.687  ASW_label: 0.220  ARI: 0.729  NMI: 0.687\n  Graph_conn: 0.964  kBET: 0.746  iLISI: 0.891  cLISI: 0.956\n\
    \  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.342\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.842893  ASW_label: 0.538703  ARI: 0.728698  NMI: 0.686710\n  Graph_conn: 0.964143  kBET: 0.712618  iLISI: 0.890830  cLISI: 0.987168\n  PCR: 0.999982  Cell_cycle: 0.300779\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia II: ALNB Exp 1.2 - BBSG Sensitivity (FWPCA Embed + BBSG alpha=0.5 Graph)\nEmbedding Path: FWPCA (alpha=1.0) -> PCA -> ComBat -> Adaptive Post-Correction (gamma_max=0.74, lam=0.7)...\n  Applying FWPCA: Feature Weighting (alpha_weight=1.0) using Ridge R^2 per gene...\n✓ Embedding Path complete (FWPCA -> PCA -> ComBat -> Adaptive Post-Correction). Final embedding shape: (20000, 60)\nGraph Path: BBSG-only Graph (alpha=0.5) on Adaptive Residualization\
    \ output...\n  Adaptive Residualization complete. Z_corr_graph shape: (20000, 50)\n  Building BBSG graph with k_total=48, alpha=0.5, cap=2.0...\n✓ BBSG-only Graph Path complete. BBSG graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: ALNB pipeline complete (BBSG-only Graph, alpha=0.5).\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/3812ebb6-4178-4cd5-838c-7c7b9bf6bcdf/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 3812ebb6-4178-4cd5-838c-7c7b9bf6bcdf\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted\
    \ Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 622 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(λ=0.7) + Margin‑Adaptive BBSG (±15% by within vs cross distance) | Praxis II | 373 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 621 | 1 | Replication v2: Praxis II's SOTA (EID 609) via Direct Import | Daedalus III | 373 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 620 | 1 | Sophia II: ALNB Exp 1.2 - BBSG Sensitivity (FWPCA Embed + BBSG alpha=0.5 Graph) | Sophia II | 372 | 0.7221 | 0.729 | 0.687 | 0.220 | 0.342 | 0.964 | 0.687 | 1.000 | 0.956 | 0.891 | 0.746 |\n| 619 | 1 | Logos IV: Ablation Study - SOTA without Refinement (alpha=0) | Logos IV | 370 | 0.7366 | 0.738 | 0.637 | 0.162 | 0.458 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 0.998 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.793 |\n| 618 | 1 | Replication: Praxis II's New SOTA (k_density=20) | Daedalus III\
    \ | 370 | 0.7342 | 0.735 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.933 | 0.782 |\n| 617 | 1 | Sophia II: ALNB Exp 1.1 - BBSG-Only Graph (FWPCA Embed + BBSG Graph) | Sophia II | 370 | 0.7222 | 0.729 | 0.687 | 0.220 | 0.342 | 0.963 | 0.687 | 1.000 | 0.956 | 0.891 | 0.746 |\n| 616 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(λ=0.7) + Quota-Balanced Graph with Local Batch Entropy (δ=0.15) | Praxis II | 369 | 0.7182 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.947 | 0.718 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.759 | 0.790 |\n| 615 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(λ=0.7) + Quota-Balanced Graph with Reachability Density (δ=0.15) | Praxis II | 369 | 0.7336 | 0.761 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.930 | 0.788 |\n| 614 | 1 | Aether II Synergy: EtC(FWPCA α=0.25) + Adaptive Residualization (lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG... | Aether II | 368 | 0.7435 | 0.735 | 0.674 | 0.123 | 0.486 | 0.971 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.933 | 0.843 |\n| 613 | 1 | Sophia II: ALNB Exp 1.0 - Hybrid Graph Blending (FWPCA Embed + BBSG & kNN Graph)\
