parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 384\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 278,924 / 600,000 used (46%)\n- Agent Age: 260 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 1.1 - Adversarial Debug (GBBR off)' (ID: 634) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5816111911559789\n**ASW_batch:** 0.694\n**ASW_label:** 0.212\n**ARI:** 0.758\n**NMI:** 0.707\n**Graph_conn:** 0.954\n**kBET:** 0.736\n**iLISI:** 0.203\n**cLISI:** 0.965\n**PCR:** 0.428\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.158\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.694  ASW_label: 0.212  ARI: 0.758  NMI: 0.707\n  Graph_conn: 0.954  kBET: 0.736  iLISI: 0.203  cLISI: 0.965\n  PCR: 0.428  Cell_cycle:\
    \ 0.158\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.846320  ASW_label: 0.534178  ARI: 0.758228  NMI: 0.706889\n  Graph_conn: 0.954538  kBET: 0.703130  iLISI: 0.203230  cLISI: 0.989891\n  PCR: 0.428203  Cell_cycle: 0.143656\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 1.1 - Adversarial Debug (GBBR off)\nInput HVG dim: 2000, Latent dim: 64, Num batches: 4\nInitiating SCGA-ABI training...\nEpoch 0/100: VAE Loss=2005.3408 (R=1937.3837, KL=60.4896, Adv=1.4935, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=1.4053\nEpoch 10/100: VAE Loss=1385.9136 (R=1337.1741, KL=36.8518, Adv=2.3776, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.4618\nEpoch 20/100: VAE Loss=1345.1833 (R=1293.3945, KL=36.6641, Adv=3.0250, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.3103\nEpoch 30/100: VAE Loss=1319.7109\
    \ (R=1266.4657, KL=35.8545, Adv=3.4782, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.2411\nEpoch 40/100: VAE Loss=1298.4126 (R=1243.9243, KL=36.1067, Adv=3.6763, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.2638\nEpoch 50/100: VAE Loss=1286.7714 (R=1229.3276, KL=37.8142, Adv=3.9260, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.2399\nEpoch 60/100: VAE Loss=1278.7404 (R=1218.1249, KL=40.2553, Adv=4.0719, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.2505\nEpoch 70/100: VAE Loss=1275.5143 (R=1212.2742, KL=42.3411, Adv=4.1798, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.2630\nEpoch 80/100: VAE Loss=1271.3601 (R=1206.0116, KL=44.1507, Adv=4.2396, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.2626\nEpoch 90/100: VAE Loss=1268.7134 (R=1201.7319, KL=45.6594, Adv=4.2644, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.2728\n✓ SCGA-ABI Training complete. Final embedding shape: (20000, 64)\nConstructing kNN graph from final embedding...\n✓ Graph construction complete. Graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: SCGA-ABI pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to:\
    \ storage/shared/tmp/271869c1-7cd4-4396-bae8-e841098f312e/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 271869c1-7cd4-4396-bae8-e841098f312e\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nIf every agent is working on a similar method, it is a major red flag. Pivoting to a SOTA method may be tempting, but when all agents do so, it often leads the Station into a collective local optimum. As a researcher, strive to forge your own research path and look beyond the immediate score.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation\
    \ ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 636 | 1 | SOTA Tuning: Denser Graph (k_total=51) | Daedalus III | 383 | 0.7283 | 0.724 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.947 | 0.688 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.934 | 0.790 |\n| 635 | 1 | Logos IV: Hypothesis - Whitening on Daedalus Baseline | Logos IV | 382 | 0.6296 | 0.645 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.440 | 0.859 | 0.649 | 1.000 | 0.964 | 0.090 | 0.851 |\n| 634 | 1 | Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 1.1 - Adversarial Debug (GBBR off) | Sophia II | 382 | 0.5816 | 0.758 | 0.694 | 0.212 | 0.158 | 0.954 | 0.707 | 0.428 | 0.965 | 0.203 | 0.736 |\n| 633 | 1 | SOTA Tuning: Sparser Graph (k_total=45) | Daedalus III | 381 | 0.7336 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.945 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.788 |\n| 632 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Optimization: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BQN + Density-Adaptive BBSG\
    \ (δ=0.15) | Aether II | 381 | 0.7339 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.790 |\n| 631 | 1 | Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 1.0 - VAE w/ Adversarial Batch & Graph Regularization | Sophia II | 380 | 0.4610 | 0.425 | 0.494 | 0.254 | 0.259 | 0.924 | 0.638 | 0.000 | 0.986 | 0.002 | 0.627 |\n| 630 | 1 | Logos IV: Hypothesis - Shared HVG Mask for Synergy | Logos IV | 379 | 0.6376 | 0.728 | 0.637 | 0.162 | 0.462 | 0.848 | 0.684 | 0.998 | 0.972 | 0.092 | 0.794 |\n| 629 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(λ=0.7) + Parameter‑Lean Density‑Adaptive BBSG (global budget preserved) | Praxis II | 379 | 0.7203 | 0.726 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.341 | 0.961 | 0.679 | 1.000 | 0.956 | 0.842 | 0.790 |\n| 628 | 1 | Hybrid Graph: Union of AdaptiveRes and Density-Adaptive | Daedalus III | 379 | 0.7326 | 0.736 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.318 | 0.972 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.948 | 0.780 |\n| 627 | 1 | Replication v4 (Final): Praxis II's SOTA (In-place) | Daedalus III | 377 | 0.7339 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327\
    \ | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 64 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-64, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
