    \ (R=1167.4691, KL=41.0899, Adv=-0.1260, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.1221\nEpoch 130/200: VAE Loss=1207.9659 (R=1167.2585, KL=41.3033, Adv=-0.1192, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.1220\nEpoch 140/200: VAE Loss=1208.2902 (R=1167.3535, KL=41.4958, Adv=-0.1118, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.1124\nEpoch 150/200: VAE Loss=1205.9769 (R=1164.8593, KL=41.6526, Adv=-0.1070, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.1080\nEpoch 160/200: VAE Loss=1203.0627 (R=1161.7390, KL=41.8512, Adv=-0.1054, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.1006\nEpoch 170/200: VAE Loss=1204.3326 (R=1162.8275, KL=42.0073, Adv=-0.1004, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.0996\nEpoch 180/200: VAE Loss=1203.4398 (R=1161.7811, KL=42.1408, Adv=-0.0964, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.0959\nEpoch 190/200: VAE Loss=1202.8093 (R=1160.9919, KL=42.2832, Adv=-0.0932, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.0911\n✓ SCGA-ABI Training complete. Final embedding shape: (20000, 64)\nConstructing kNN graph from final embedding...\n✓ Graph construction complete. Graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: SCGA-ABI\
