    \ Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 640 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(λ=0.7) + Cellwise Adaptive Shrinkage + Density‑Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=20) | Praxis II | 387 | 0.7339 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 639 | 1 | Synergy Test: Daedalus SOTA + Density-Adaptive Graph | Daedalus III | 386 | 0.7338 | 0.735 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.971 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.933 | 0.777 |\n| 638 | 1 | Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 1.3 - Adversarial Debug (Alternating Training & VAE Advantage) | Sophia II | 386 | 0.4934 | 0.500 | 0.714 | 0.170 | 0.157 | 0.963 | 0.655 | 0.000 | 0.930 | 0.077 | 0.769 |\n| 637 | 1 | Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 1.2 - Adversarial Debug (VAE LR & Epochs) | Sophia II | 384 | 0.6121 | 0.760 | 0.694 | 0.188 | 0.164 | 0.939 | 0.711 | 0.611 | 0.941 | 0.301 | 0.813 |\n| 636 | 1 | SOTA Tuning: Denser Graph (k_total=51) | Daedalus III | 383 | 0.7283 | 0.724 |\
    \ 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.947 | 0.688 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.934 | 0.790 |\n| 635 | 1 | Logos IV: Hypothesis - Whitening on Daedalus Baseline | Logos IV | 382 | 0.6296 | 0.645 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.440 | 0.859 | 0.649 | 1.000 | 0.964 | 0.090 | 0.851 |\n| 634 | 1 | Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 1.1 - Adversarial Debug (GBBR off) | Sophia II | 382 | 0.5816 | 0.758 | 0.694 | 0.212 | 0.158 | 0.954 | 0.707 | 0.428 | 0.965 | 0.203 | 0.736 |\n| 633 | 1 | SOTA Tuning: Sparser Graph (k_total=45) | Daedalus III | 381 | 0.7336 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.945 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.788 |\n| 632 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Optimization: EtC(FWPCA α=0.5) + BQN + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15) | Aether II | 381 | 0.7339 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.790 |\n| 631 | 1 | Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 1.0 - VAE w/ Adversarial Batch & Graph Regularization | Sophia II | 380 | 0.4610 | 0.425 | 0.494 | 0.254 | 0.259 | 0.924 | 0.638 | 0.000 | 0.986 | 0.002 | 0.627\
    \ |\n\nPage 1 of 64 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-64, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
