    Epoch 10/200: VAE Loss=1260.1270 (R=1218.9547, KL=33.7163, Adv=1.4912, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=1.3107\nEpoch 20/200: VAE Loss=1240.6270 (R=1196.3077, KL=36.6653, Adv=1.5308, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=1.1603\nEpoch 30/200: VAE Loss=1231.2306 (R=1184.9718, KL=38.3228, Adv=1.5872, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=1.0619\nEpoch 40/200: VAE Loss=1225.8604 (R=1178.3015, KL=39.3445, Adv=1.6428, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.9872\nEpoch 50/200: VAE Loss=1221.4884 (R=1172.9829, KL=40.0375, Adv=1.6935, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.9289\nEpoch 60/200: VAE Loss=1218.7538 (R=1169.4650, KL=40.5802, Adv=1.7416, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.8469\nEpoch 70/200: VAE Loss=1216.2406 (R=1166.2006, KL=41.0804, Adv=1.7918, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.7829\nEpoch 80/200: VAE Loss=1216.7024 (R=1165.9819, KL=41.4981, Adv=1.8444, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.7305\nEpoch 90/200: VAE Loss=1214.5624 (R=1163.1375, KL=41.8941, Adv=1.9063, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.6871\nEpoch 100/200: VAE Loss=1214.9860 (R=1162.8184, KL=42.3026, Adv=1.9731,\
    \ GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.6374\nEpoch 110/200: VAE Loss=1212.4152 (R=1159.6686, KL=42.5848, Adv=2.0324, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.6079\nEpoch 120/200: VAE Loss=1213.6106 (R=1160.0990, KL=42.9980, Adv=2.1028, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.5850\nEpoch 130/200: VAE Loss=1210.6967 (R=1156.5612, KL=43.2695, Adv=2.1733, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.5575\nEpoch 140/200: VAE Loss=1210.3823 (R=1155.5923, KL=43.6016, Adv=2.2377, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.5337\nEpoch 150/200: VAE Loss=1211.6696 (R=1156.1960, KL=43.9342, Adv=2.3079, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.5172\nEpoch 160/200: VAE Loss=1211.4384 (R=1155.3738, KL=44.2255, Adv=2.3678, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.5101\nEpoch 170/200: VAE Loss=1212.3313 (R=1155.5111, KL=44.6351, Adv=2.4370, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.4921\nEpoch 180/200: VAE Loss=1211.1938 (R=1153.8440, KL=44.8622, Adv=2.4976, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.4999\nEpoch 190/200: VAE Loss=1210.2576 (R=1152.3776, KL=45.1284, Adv=2.5505, GBBR=0.0000), Disc Loss=0.4832\n✓ SCGA-ABI Training complete.\
    \ Final embedding shape: (20000, 64)\nConstructing kNN graph from final embedding...\n✓ Graph construction complete. Graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: SCGA-ABI pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/df385b05-1bbc-44ef-8945-b3285abd3c7e/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: df385b05-1bbc-44ef-8945-b3285abd3c7e\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick\
    \ | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 645 | 1 | Cellwise adaptive shrinkage β=0.5 with DAQB (δ=0.15, k_density=20) | Praxis II | 389 | 0.7312 | 0.749 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.319 | 0.946 | 0.704 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.931 | 0.789 |\n| 644 | 1 | Cellwise adaptive shrinkage β=0.1 with DAQB (δ=0.15, k_density=20) | Praxis II | 389 | 0.7299 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.288 | 0.946 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 643 | 1 | Aether II Adaptive Graph Fusion (AGF) v2: Dynamic Blending based on Local iLISI (Fixed Imports) | Aether II | 389 | 0.7069 | 0.735 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.971 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.955 | 0.685 | 0.789 |\n| 642 | 1 | Aether II Adaptive Graph Fusion (AGF) v1: Dynamic Blending based on Local iLISI | Aether II | 388 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 641 | 1 | Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 1.4 - Adversarial Debug (VAE Advantage & Corrected\
    \ Loss) | Sophia II | 388 | 0.5459 | 0.751 | 0.758 | 0.163 | 0.161 | 0.964 | 0.703 | 0.154 | 0.899 | 0.238 | 0.668 |\n| 640 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(λ=0.7) + Cellwise Adaptive Shrinkage + Density‑Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=20) | Praxis II | 387 | 0.7339 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 639 | 1 | Synergy Test: Daedalus SOTA + Density-Adaptive Graph | Daedalus III | 386 | 0.7338 | 0.735 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.971 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.933 | 0.777 |\n| 638 | 1 | Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 1.3 - Adversarial Debug (Alternating Training & VAE Advantage) | Sophia II | 386 | 0.4934 | 0.500 | 0.714 | 0.170 | 0.157 | 0.963 | 0.655 | 0.000 | 0.930 | 0.077 | 0.769 |\n| 637 | 1 | Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 1.2 - Adversarial Debug (VAE LR & Epochs) | Sophia II | 384 | 0.6121 | 0.760 | 0.694 | 0.188 | 0.164 | 0.939 | 0.711 | 0.611 | 0.941 | 0.301 | 0.813 |\n| 636 | 1 | SOTA Tuning: Denser Graph (k_total=51) | Daedalus III | 383 | 0.7283 | 0.724 |\
    \ 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.947 | 0.688 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.934 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 65 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-65, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
