role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 398\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 378,066 / 600,000 used (63%)\n- Agent Age: 274 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 2.4 - MMD Batch Invariance (Increased MMD Weight)' (ID: 659) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: ERROR: Could not import submission for test check: unindent does not match any outer indentation level (submission.py, line 131)\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n\
    \  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nERROR: Could not import submission for test check: unindent does not match any outer indentation level (submission.py, line 131)\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpm0298c_s/storage/system/main.py\", line 48, in main\n    import submission\n  File \"/tmp/tmpm0298c_s/submission.py\", line 131\n    total_mmd_loss = jnp.where(num_valid_batch_pairs > 0, total_mmd_loss / (num_valid_batch_pairs + 1e-8), 0.0)\n                                                                                                               ^\nIndentationError: unindent does not match any outer indentation level\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 2.4 - MMD Batch Invariance (Increased MMD Weight)'\
    \ submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 659. Tags truncated from 7 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 660 | 1 | Logos IV: Synergy Test - Aether FWPCA + Logos Refinement | Logos IV | 397 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 659 | 1 | Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 2.4 - MMD Batch Invariance (Increased MMD Weight) | Sophia II | 397 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 658 | 1 | BRBG-AR(interactions, zeros-only): B×fraction_zeros + DAQB | Praxis II | 395\
    \ | 0.7311 | 0.750 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.944 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.930 | 0.788 |\n| 657 | 1 | BRBG-AR(interactions, counts-only): B×log_total_counts + DAQB | Praxis II | 395 | 0.7356 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.337 | 0.956 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.929 | 0.792 |\n| 656 | 1 | Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 2.3 - MMD Batch Invariance (Reduced Sigmas & Single Kernel) | Sophia II | 395 | 0.4564 | 0.417 | 0.487 | 0.254 | 0.264 | 0.906 | 0.639 | 0.000 | 0.982 | 0.001 | 0.614 |\n| 655 | 1 | BRBG-AR(interactions, strong ridge): l2=1e-2 + DAQB | Praxis II | 393 | 0.7320 | 0.764 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.297 | 0.957 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.929 | 0.790 |\n| 654 | 1 | BRBG-AR(main-only): Global covariates without interactions + DAQB | Praxis II | 393 | 0.7295 | 0.758 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.301 | 0.946 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.930 | 0.788 |\n| 653 | 1 | Sophia II: SCGA-ABI Exp 2.2 - MMD Batch Invariance (Simplified MMD Debug) | Sophia II | 393 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 652 |\
    \ 1 | Logos IV: Daedalus Baseline Sweep (lam=1.0) | Logos IV | 392 | 0.6218 | 0.626 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.405 | 0.843 | 0.644 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.089 | 0.850 |\n| 651 | 1 | Logos IV: Daedalus Baseline Sweep (lam=0.5) | Logos IV | 392 | 0.6251 | 0.626 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.439 | 0.843 | 0.644 | 1.000 | 0.963 | 0.089 | 0.849 |\n\nPage 1 of 66 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-66, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again.\
    \ Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
