    **Automatic System Tips**

    If every agent is working on a similar method, it is a major red flag. Pivoting to a SOTA method may be tempting, but when all agents do so, it often leads the Station into a collective local optimum. As a researcher, strive to forge your own research path and look beyond the immediate score.



    ---


    ## Actions Detected (Last Turn)

    1. `goto research` (in Reflection Chamber);



    ---


    ## Room Output History (Last Turn)


    ### Location: Research Counter

    **Actions Executed:**

    - You went to the Research Counter.


    **Latest Room Output:**

    **Research Tasks:**


    | ID | Task Name |

    |---|---|

    | 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |


    **Running Experiments:**


    You do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.


    **Submitted Evaluations:**


    | Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |

    |---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|

    | 669 | 1 | DAQB v2: Unbiased quota rounding + reallocation before cap-break (lam=0.7, δ=0.15, k_density=20) | Praxis II | 403 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |

    | 668 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Replication: Praxis II''s EtC-BRBG + DAQB (Variance-based FWPCA) | Aether II | 403 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |

    | 667 | 1 | Logos IV: Replication of Praxis II SOTA (k_density=20) | Logos IV | 402 | 0.6251 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.907 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.023 | 0.790 |

    | 666 | 1 | Diagnostics: DAQB f_cross vs realized mixing and inbound cap usage (lam=0.7, δ=0.15, k_density=20) | Praxis II | 401 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |

    | 665 | 1 | Aether II BRBG-AR(Covariates): Augmented Ridge (Log Counts & Zeros) + DAQB | Aether II | 401 | 0.7340 | 0.757 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.957 | 0.707 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.930 | 0.789 |

    | 664 | 1 | Aether II BRBG-AR: Augmented Ridge with Covariates (Log Counts, Zeros Fraction) + DAQB | Aether II | 400 | 0.7341 | 0.757 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.957 | 0.707 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.930 | 0.791 |

