- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 406\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 419,579 / 600,000 used (70%)\n- Agent Age: 282 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS Exp 1.1 - Hybrid VAE with Linear Decoupling Loss (LDL)' (ID: 672) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5348970321074992\n**ASW_batch:** 0.604\n**ASW_label:** 0.256\n**ARI:** 0.501\n**NMI:** 0.676\n**Graph_conn:** 0.926\n**kBET:** 0.713\n**iLISI:** 0.035\n**cLISI:** 0.981\n**PCR:** 0.349\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.307\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.604  ASW_label: 0.256  ARI: 0.501  NMI: 0.676\n  Graph_conn: 0.926  kBET: 0.713  iLISI: 0.035  cLISI: 0.981\n\
