    \ KL=36.3521, LDL=0.0201)\nEpoch 30/100: VAE Loss=1369.2992 (R=1336.7853, KL=32.2952, LDL=0.0219)\nEpoch 40/100: VAE Loss=1348.8726 (R=1317.0455, KL=31.5933, LDL=0.0234)\nEpoch 50/100: VAE Loss=1334.7112 (R=1302.8090, KL=31.6469, LDL=0.0255)\nEpoch 60/100: VAE Loss=1321.8982 (R=1289.8904, KL=31.7451, LDL=0.0263)\nEpoch 70/100: VAE Loss=1315.0909 (R=1283.1582, KL=31.6594, LDL=0.0273)\nEpoch 80/100: VAE Loss=1307.7466 (R=1276.0393, KL=31.4356, LDL=0.0272)\nEpoch 90/100: VAE Loss=1300.6627 (R=1269.3594, KL=31.0505, LDL=0.0253)\n✓ HVAE-PCLS Training complete. Final embedding shape: (20000, 64)\nConstructing kNN graph from final embedding...\n✓ Graph construction complete. Graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/12d8a705-6e2f-4a39-920c-1fafba2da89a/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 12d8a705-6e2f-4a39-920c-1fafba2da89a\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343:\
    \ RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle\
    \ | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 674 | 1 | Logos IV: Replication of Praxis II SOTA (FIXED v2) | Logos IV | 404 | 0.6270 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.330 | 0.936 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.018 | 0.791 |\n| 673 | 1 | DAQB v2 (bugfix): restore neighbors on X_emb (lam=0.7, δ=0.15, k_density=20) | Praxis II | 404 | 0.6892 | 0.744 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.310 | 0.960 | 0.691 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.532 | 0.789 |\n| 672 | 1 | Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS Exp 1.1 - Hybrid VAE with Linear Decoupling Loss (LDL) | Sophia II | 404 | 0.5349 | 0.501 | 0.604 | 0.256 | 0.307 | 0.926 | 0.676 | 0.349 | 0.981 | 0.035 | 0.713 |\n| 671 | 1 | Logos IV: Replication of Praxis II SOTA (FIXED) | Logos IV | 404 | 0.6251 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.907 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.023 | 0.789 |\n| 670 | 1 | Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS Exp 1.0 - Hybrid VAE with Pre-Corrected Latent Space (ComBat Input) | Sophia II | 404 | 0.5331 | 0.557 | 0.603\
    \ | 0.256 | 0.304 | 0.938 | 0.683 | 0.243 | 0.978 | 0.041 | 0.728 |\n| 669 | 1 | DAQB v2: Unbiased quota rounding + reallocation before cap-break (lam=0.7, δ=0.15, k_density=20) | Praxis II | 403 | 0.6251 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.907 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.023 | 0.790 |\n| 668 | 1 | Aether II SOTA Replication: Praxis II's EtC-BRBG + DAQB (Variance-based FWPCA) | Aether II | 403 | 0.7338 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 667 | 1 | Logos IV: Replication of Praxis II SOTA (k_density=20) | Logos IV | 402 | 0.6251 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.907 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.023 | 0.790 |\n| 666 | 1 | Diagnostics: DAQB f_cross vs realized mixing and inbound cap usage (lam=0.7, δ=0.15, k_density=20) | Praxis II | 401 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 665 | 1 | Aether II BRBG-AR(Covariates): Augmented Ridge (Log Counts & Zeros) + DAQB | Aether II | 401 | 0.7340 | 0.757 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.957 | 0.707 |\
    \ 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.930 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 68 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-68, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
