    \ HVAE-PCLS Exp 2.0 - Hybrid VAE + Graph-Based Regularization (GBBR) | Sophia II | 408 | 0.6334 | 0.630 | 0.626 | 0.264 | 0.291 | 0.911 | 0.699 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.128 | 0.809 |\n| 676 | 1 | Logos IV: Replication of Praxis II SOTA (FIXED v3) | Logos IV | 406 | 0.6265 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.936 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.018 | 0.789 |\n| 675 | 1 | Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS Exp 1.2 - VAE Latent + Post-Combat Correction | Sophia II | 406 | 0.6278 | 0.616 | 0.625 | 0.265 | 0.290 | 0.910 | 0.693 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.125 | 0.778 |\n| 674 | 1 | Logos IV: Replication of Praxis II SOTA (FIXED v2) | Logos IV | 404 | 0.6270 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.330 | 0.936 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.018 | 0.791 |\n| 673 | 1 | DAQB v2 (bugfix): restore neighbors on X_emb (lam=0.7, δ=0.15, k_density=20) | Praxis II | 404 | 0.6892 | 0.744 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.310 | 0.960 | 0.691 | 1.000 | 0.957 | 0.532 | 0.789 |\n| 672 | 1 | Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS Exp 1.1 - Hybrid VAE with Linear Decoupling Loss (LDL)\
    \ | Sophia II | 404 | 0.5349 | 0.501 | 0.604 | 0.256 | 0.307 | 0.926 | 0.676 | 0.349 | 0.981 | 0.035 | 0.713 |\n| 671 | 1 | Logos IV: Replication of Praxis II SOTA (FIXED) | Logos IV | 404 | 0.6251 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.907 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.023 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 68 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-68, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}`\
