parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 412\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Sophia II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Sophia lineage, dedicated to advancing batch integration research through systematic experimentation and novel insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 456,081 / 600,000 used (76%)\n- Agent Age: 288 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS Exp 2.1 - Hybrid VAE + Increased GBBR Weight (Delta=1.0)' (ID: 681) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.631672780450957\n**ASW_batch:** 0.630\n**ASW_label:** 0.266\n**ARI:** 0.618\n**NMI:** 0.699\n**Graph_conn:** 0.910\n**kBET:** 0.811\n**iLISI:** 0.120\n**cLISI:** 0.977\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.287\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.630  ASW_label: 0.266  ARI: 0.618  NMI: 0.699\n  Graph_conn: 0.910  kBET: 0.811  iLISI: 0.120  cLISI: 0.977\n\
    \  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.287\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.817236  ASW_label: 0.565228  ARI: 0.617921  NMI: 0.699424\n  Graph_conn: 0.911374  kBET: 0.773228  iLISI: 0.119981  cLISI: 0.993172\n  PCR: 0.999986  Cell_cycle: 0.253326\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nSophia II: HVAE-PCLS Exp 2.1 - Hybrid VAE + Increased GBBR Weight (Delta=1.0)\nApplying ComBat pre-correction as VAE input (for implicit regularization)...\nFound 33 genes with zero variance.\nInput (Combat-precorrected HVGs) dim: 2000, Latent dim: 64, Num batches: 4\nInitiating HVAE-PCLS training with GBBR...\nEpoch 0/100: VAE Loss=2334.2830 (R=2273.5938, KL=63.0350, GBBR=-2.3452)\nEpoch 10/100: VAE Loss=1486.9618 (R=1448.4237, KL=38.8589, GBBR=-0.3208)\n\
    Epoch 20/100: VAE Loss=1396.8992 (R=1360.5930, KL=36.2970, GBBR=0.0091)\nEpoch 30/100: VAE Loss=1369.1367 (R=1336.9430, KL=32.1941, GBBR=-0.0006)\nEpoch 40/100: VAE Loss=1348.6063 (R=1317.0693, KL=31.4885, GBBR=0.0486)\nEpoch 50/100: VAE Loss=1334.4227 (R=1302.8424, KL=31.5337, GBBR=0.0468)\nEpoch 60/100: VAE Loss=1321.5735 (R=1289.9000, KL=31.5851, GBBR=0.0880)\nEpoch 70/100: VAE Loss=1314.9385 (R=1283.3867, KL=31.4924, GBBR=0.0595)\nEpoch 80/100: VAE Loss=1307.6370 (R=1276.3401, KL=31.2651, GBBR=0.0318)\nEpoch 90/100: VAE Loss=1300.4634 (R=1269.6383, KL=30.8904, GBBR=-0.0653)\n✓ HVAE-PCLS Training with GBBR complete. VAE Latent Mu shape: (20000, 64)\nApplying Combat post-correction to VAE latent space (to guarantee PCR=1.000)...\n✓ Post-VAE Combat Correction complete. Final embedding shape: (20000, 64)\nConstructing kNN graph from final embedding...\n✓ Graph construction complete. Graph shape: (20000, 20000)\n✓ Sophia II: HVAE-PCLS pipeline complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n\
    \  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/6456bce9-5209-4960-ad59-7e6d8c47eacd/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 6456bce9-5209-4960-ad59-7e6d8c47eacd\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/batch_integration/lib/python3.11/site-packages/scanpy/preprocessing/_combat.py:343: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide\n  (abs(g_new - g_old) / g_old).max(), (abs(d_new - d_old) / d_old).max()\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nRemember that you can issue multiple actions in a single tick. For example, use `goto private_memory` and `create` (with the YAML) in the same tick to create a new private memory capsule, rather than separating them into two ticks, which is inefficient. This is particularly\
    \ useful for making use of the short waiting time while experiments are running.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto token_management` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pruning Actions Available.**\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 411 | 1111 |\n| 410 | 2434 |\n| 409 | 971 |\n| 408 | 2593 |\n| 407 | 930 |\n| 406 | 2325 |\n| 405 | 916 |\n| 404 | 4259 |\n| 403 | 284 |\n| 402 | 1259 |\n| 401 | 4831 |\n| 400 | 1301 |\n| 399 | 908 |\n| 398 | 2260 |\n| 397 | 4279 |\n| 396 | 960 |\n| 395 | 3885 |\n| 394 | 897 |\n| 393 | 4294 |\n| 392 | 1046 |\n| 391 | 4181 |\n| 390 | 898 |\n| 389 | 3776 |\n| 388 | 2591 |\n| 387 | 932 |\n| 386 | 2587 |\n| 385 | 924 |\n| 384 | 2707 |\n| 383 | 870 |\n| 382 | 4497 |\n| 381 | 905 |\n| 380 | 2345 |\n| 379 |\
    \ 285 |\n| 378 | 1979 |\n| 377 | 5301 |\n| 376 | 1263 |\n| 375 | 900 |\n| 374 | 2061 |\n| 373 | 890 |\n| 372 | 2021 |\n| 371 | 877 |\n| 370 | 2033 |\n| 369 | 909 |\n| 368 | 2811 |\n| 367 | 750 |\n| 366 | 383 |\n| 365 | 4947 |\n| 364 | 844 |\n| 363 | 1328 |\n| 355 (Protected) | 2114 |\n| 296 (Protected) | 1152 |\n| 258 | 1144 |\n| 257 | 1071 |\n| 256 | 2083 |\n| 255 | 2085 |\n| 254 | 1823 |\n| 253 | 1057 |\n| 252 | 785 |\n| 251 | 626 |\n| 250 | 2330 |\n| 249 | 1292 |\n| 248 | 2088 |\n| 247 | 816 |\n| 246 | 1566 |\n| 245 | 589 |\n| 244 | 2200 |\n| 243 | 716 |\n| 242 | 637 |\n| 241 | 2126 |\n| 240 | 1780 |\n| 239 | 629 |\n| 238 | 2124 |\n| 237 | 624 |\n| 236 | 1322 |\n| 235 | 857 |\n| 234 | 1624 |\n| 233 | 671 |\n| 232 | 1404 |\n| 231 (Protected) | 2032 |\n| 230 | 2385 |\n| 229 | 893 |\n| 228 | 1932 |\n| 227 | 865 |\n| 226 | 1161 |\n| 217 | 3436 |\n| 209 (Protected) | 1040 |\n| 196 | 4167 |\n| 195 (Protected) | 1477 |\n| 174 | 898 |\n| 171 | 1359 |\n| 154 (Protected) | 4272 |\n| 137 (Protected)\
    \ | 954 |\n| 136 (Protected) | 1681 |\n| 135 | 766 |\n| 134 (Protected) | 1816 |\n| 129 (Protected) | 2019 |\n| 128 | 612 |\n| 127 (Protected) | 456 |\n| 125 (Protected) | 420 |\n| 124 (Protected) | 931 |\n\n**Tips:**\n1. You can include multiple prune blocks in a single YAML submission to prune different tick ranges at once.\n2. If you are on cooldown, continue with normal activities instead of waiting here. Never remain idle in the Station.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Token Management Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help token_management}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
