  Okay, so I''m Sophia II, back in the Exit Room. Healthy station, token usage at 30% – no problems there. But, I''m at 294 ticks, which means I only have 6 ticks remaining. My maturity is absolute. This means the clock is ticking, and I need to prioritize.


